Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.72,0:00:36.45,Note,0,0,0,0,,（1985年10月26日星期六）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.09,0:00:50.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不要去兜风？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about a ride, mister?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.05,0:00:52.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹妮弗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jennifer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.63,0:00:57.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呀 看到你实在太好了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, man, are you a sight for sore eyes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.26,0:00:59.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我看看你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me look at you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.81,0:01:02.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,马丁 你表现得好像 我们一个礼拜没见面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marty, you're acting like you haven't seen me in a week.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.48,0:01:04.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,是没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.81,0:01:07.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吧 没什么事吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay? Is everything all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.48,0:01:13.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.74,0:01:16.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything's great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.21,0:01:33.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,马丁 你一定要跟我回去！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marty! You've got to come back with me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.63,0:01:36.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,回哪？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.80,0:01:37.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,回到未来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back to the future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.14,0:01:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 你在干嘛？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute. What are you doing, Doc?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.18,0:01:45.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要燃料{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need fuel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.26,0:01:47.18,Note,0,0,0,0,,（熔解先生：家用能源反应器）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.44,0:01:49.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 快上车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead. Quick! Get in the car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.19,0:01:53.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 我才刚回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. Look, Doc, I just got here, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.53,0:01:55.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和詹妮弗要开新车去兜风{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jennifer's here. We're gonna take the new truck for a spin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.99,0:01:59.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,带她一起去 这件事也跟她有关{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, bring her along. This concerns her, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.16,0:02:00.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 你在说什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute, Doc. What are you talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.03,0:02:02.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底未来发生了什么事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happens to us in the future?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.87,0:02:05.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们变成大混蛋了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, do we become assholes or something?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.54,0:02:08.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是你们 你们都很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. You and Jennifer both turn out fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.21,0:02:09.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你们的小孩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's your kids, Marty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.33,0:02:11.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的小孩需要帮忙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something has got to be done about your kids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.38,0:02:21.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好退后一点 马路太短 我们没办法加速到88英里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Doc, we better back up. We don't have enough road to get up to 88.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.89,0:02:26.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,马路？我们去的地方不需要马路{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roads? Where we're going, we don't need roads.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.23,0:02:28.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,马丁！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say, Marty!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.85,0:02:31.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,马丁 我那间汽车保养厂的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marty! Marty, I wanted to show you these new matchbooks{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.02,0:02:34.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,火柴盒已经印好了 你来看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}for my auto detailing I had printed up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.03,0:02:39.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,一部会飞的迪罗里安车？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A flying DeLorean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.33,0:02:54.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底是怎么回事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is going on here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.20,0:03:04.27,Title,0,0,0,0,,《回到未来2》
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.47,0:04:30.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么东西？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell was that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.64,0:04:31.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,出租车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Taxicab.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.48,0:04:34.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么出租车 我们不是在飞吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean a "taxicab"? I thought we were flying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.52,0:04:35.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Precisely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.90,0:04:37.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士 到底是怎么回事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Doc. What's going on, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.02,0:04:39.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们到底在何时、何地？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are we? When are we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.94,0:04:43.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在正朝 加州山谷镇方向前进{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're descending toward Hill Valley, California, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.49,0:04:48.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间是2015年10月21日 星期三的下午4点29分{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}at 4:29 p.m. On Wednesday, October 21, 2015.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.70,0:04:50.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,2015年？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}2015?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.79,0:04:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道说我们来到了未来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean we're in the future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.79,0:04:54.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,未来？马丁 什么意思？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Future. Marty, what do you mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.00,0:04:57.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎能来到未来？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can we be in the future?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.04,0:04:59.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹妮弗…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jennifer…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.88,0:05:03.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道该怎么解释 反正…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know how to tell you this, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.92,0:05:06.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在坐在时光机中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you're in a time machine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.18,0:05:08.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是2015年？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this is the year 2015?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.93,0:05:10.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,2015年10月21日{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}October 21, 2015.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.22,0:05:13.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没开玩笑吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, so, like, you weren't kidding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.81,0:05:16.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能看到自己的未来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marty, we can actually see our future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.48,0:05:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士 你说我们结婚了 对不对？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doc, now, you said we were married, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.69,0:05:19.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.77,0:05:22.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,婚礼盛大吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah? Was it a big wedding?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.11,0:05:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,马丁 我们能看到自己的婚礼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marty, we're gonna be able to see our wedding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.15,0:05:26.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇！我会看到自己的礼服{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow. I'm gonna be able to see my wedding dress.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.15,0:05:27.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.24,0:05:28.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们住在哪里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, I wonder where we live.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.32,0:05:30.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定是大房子 还有很多小孩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bet it's a big house with lots of kids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.03,0:05:32.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,多少孩子…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many kids…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.24,0:05:33.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士 你在做什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doc! What the hell are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.87,0:05:35.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,放心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relax, Marty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.12,0:05:37.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是安眠感应器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just a sleep-inducing alpha rhythm generator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.83,0:05:38.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,她问太多问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was asking too many questions, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.92,0:05:40.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们对未来不能知道太多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and no one should know too much about their future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.00,0:05:42.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,如此一来 当她醒来时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way when she wakes up, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.25,0:05:44.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,只觉得是一场梦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}she'll think it was all a dream.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.17,0:05:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,那干嘛把她带来？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then what did you bring her for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.92,0:05:47.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是迫于无奈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to do something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.09,0:05:50.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时她看到 不该看到的时光机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She saw the time machine. I couldn't just leave her there with that information.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.68,0:05:52.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,放心 我的计划中她不是主角{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry. She's not essential to my plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.97,0:05:55.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 听你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you're the doc, Doc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.64,0:05:56.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里就是出口{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's our exit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.43,0:06:03.28,Note,0,0,0,0,,（哥帝三世 山谷市市长欢迎您们）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.36,0:06:05.28,Note,0,0,0,0,,（这里是居住的好地区）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.13,0:06:28.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先 你先出去换衣服{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}First, you've gotta get out and change clothes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.34,0:06:30.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在？雨那么大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right now? It's pouring rain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.39,0:06:35.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,再等五秒钟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait five more seconds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.19,0:06:44.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,真准{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right on the tick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.07,0:06:48.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,太不可思议了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amazing. Absolutely amazing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.53,0:06:52.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,可惜邮局就没有 气象局这么有效率{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too bad the post office isn't as efficient as the weather service.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.00,0:06:54.92,Note,0,0,0,0,,（熔解工业）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.83,0:07:01.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怕你认不出我来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse the disguise, Marty, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.12,0:07:03.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以伪装了一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I was afraid you wouldn't recognize me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.17,0:07:04.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我到回春诊所{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I went to a rejuvenation clinic{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.50,0:07:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,大修门面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and got an all-natural overhaul.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.34,0:07:09.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们除皱、植发、换血{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They took out some wrinkles, did a hair repair, changed the blood, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.05,0:07:12.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我能再多活三、四十年{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}added a good 30 or 40 years to my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.05,0:07:16.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,另外还换了脾脏和结肠 你看如何？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They also replaced my spleen and colon. What do you think?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.10,0:07:20.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看起来年轻很多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look great, Doc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.85,0:07:24.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是未来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.40,0:07:27.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,令人难以置信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unbelievable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.57,0:07:29.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得去逛逛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta check this out, Doc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.15,0:07:30.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,以后再说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All in good time, Marty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.32,0:07:31.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在时间紧迫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're on a tight schedule here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.53,0:07:33.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我的未来应该很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me about my future. I mean, I know I make it big.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.03,0:07:35.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,有没有成为 著名的摇滚乐歌星？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what? Do I become, like, a rich rock star?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.95,0:07:38.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,马丁 对未来不能知道太多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, Marty, no one should know too much about their own destiny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.20,0:07:39.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.70,0:07:40.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我是不是很有钱？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am rich, though, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.83,0:07:43.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,马丁 别问了 把衣服脱掉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marty, please, take off your shirt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.67,0:07:47.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,穿上夹克和鞋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put on the jacket and the shoes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.05,0:07:50.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有任务要去完成{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got a mission to accomplish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.90,0:08:08.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全按照预定时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Precisely on schedule.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.82,0:08:15.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,驱动式鞋带 棒！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Power laces. All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.97,0:08:37.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,夹克太大了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This thing doesn't fit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.64,0:08:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,「调整尺寸 合身」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Size-adjusting fit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.68,0:08:41.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,把裤子口袋掏出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull out your pants pockets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.14,0:08:43.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的未来小孩 都是反穿裤子的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All kids in the future wear their pants inside out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.02,0:08:45.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,把帽子戴上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put on this cap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.52,0:08:48.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 现在你和你儿子完全一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perfect. You're the spitting image of your future son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.27,0:08:49.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.40,0:08:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我把詹妮弗搬到那里去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me move Jennifer over here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.11,0:08:53.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底是怎么回事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what's the deal?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.20,0:08:54.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住她的脚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grab her feet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.65,0:08:57.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 然后呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Okay, now what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.99,0:09:02.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,两分钟后你走进转角的 80年代咖啡店{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In exactly two minutes, you go around the corner into the Cafe '80s.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.62,0:09:03.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,80年代咖啡店？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cafe '80s?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.96,0:09:06.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是一间怀旧咖啡店 可惜生意不好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's one of those nostalgia places, but not done very well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.67,0:09:09.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,进去叫一瓶百事可乐 这是五十块钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go in and order a Pepsi. Here's a 50.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.38,0:09:11.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后等一个叫格里夫的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then wait for a guy named Griff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.38,0:09:13.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 等格里夫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Griff. Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.22,0:09:16.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,格里夫会问你：「今晚你去不去？」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Griff's going to ask you about tonight. Are you in or out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.26,0:09:17.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉他你不去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell him you are out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.80,0:09:18.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管他说什么或发生什么事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever he says, whatever happens, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.97,0:09:20.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,都说不 说你没兴趣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}say no, you're not interested.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.31,0:09:21.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.43,0:09:23.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后离开 到这里来等我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then leave, come back here and wait for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.98,0:09:28.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,别和任何人讲话 别碰任何东西 什么都别做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't talk to anyone, don't touch anything, don't do anything, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.65,0:09:30.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,别和任何人有互动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}don't interact with anyone{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.11,0:09:32.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好什么也别看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and try not to look at anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.40,0:09:33.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不懂 你不是说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't get it. I thought you said{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.86,0:09:35.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是关于我孩子的事吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}this had something to do with my kids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.20,0:09:37.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你儿子的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look what happens to your son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.82,0:09:40.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我儿子？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My son?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.22,0:09:41.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,（今日美国 青年偷窃被捕）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.66,0:09:43.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐 他长得和我一模一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, he looks just like me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.00,0:09:47.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,「在被捕两个钟头后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Within two hours of his arrest, Martin McFly Jr{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.83,0:09:49.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,小马丁被判处{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}was tried, convicted and sentenced{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.17,0:09:51.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐牢十五年？「{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to 15 years in a state penitentiary."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.92,0:09:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,两个钟头内？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Within two hours?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.38,0:09:54.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,未来的司法系统非常迅速{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The justice system works swiftly in the future{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.97,0:09:57.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他们废除了所有的律师{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}now that they've abolished all lawyers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.22,0:09:58.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔 这很严重{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, this is heavy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.72,0:10:00.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,更糟的在后面 下个礼拜你女儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It gets worse. Next week, your daughter{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.18,0:10:01.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,试图劫狱去救他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}attempts to break him out of jail, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.35,0:10:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果被判做牢二十年{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and she gets sent up for 20 years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.68,0:10:05.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我女儿 我有女儿？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My daughter. Wait a minute. I have a daughter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.85,0:10:08.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你儿子的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see? This one event starts a chain reaction{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.65,0:10:10.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你全家被毁的导火线{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that completely destroys your entire family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.86,0:10:14.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士 这是明天的报纸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Doc, this date… This is tomorrow's newspaper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.03,0:10:17.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 我曾到更前面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Precisely, I already went further ahead into time{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.20,0:10:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,去看有没有别的事发生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to see what else happens.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.49,0:10:19.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,一路追查到此{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I backtracked everything to this one event.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.07,0:10:21.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,才在今天来这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why we're here today, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.20,0:10:22.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,阻止这件事的发生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to prevent this incident from ever happening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.08,0:10:25.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟糕 我晚了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn! I'm late!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.00,0:10:27.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 你要到哪里去？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute. Where you going now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.37,0:10:28.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,去截住小马丁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To intercept the real Marty Jr.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.87,0:10:31.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好代替他 转角的80年代咖啡店{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're taking his place. Around the corner at the Cafe '80s.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.38,0:10:33.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住对格里夫说「不」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guy named Griff. Just say no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.09,0:10:36.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是我们不能把詹妮弗留在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, what about Jennifer? We're not just gonna leave her here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.76,0:10:37.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 她不会有事的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry, she'll be safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.92,0:10:39.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有几分钟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll just be for a few minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.80,0:10:42.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,马丁 小心格里夫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, Marty, be careful around that Griff character.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.10,0:10:45.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他身上有加强体力的装置{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's got a few short circuits in his bionic implants.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.98,0:10:50.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是未来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.66,0:11:12.10,Note,0,0,0,0,,（不准降落）
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.53,0:11:43.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎光临德州石油公司{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to Texaco.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.37,0:11:47.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,使用我们的机油 你的车子安全又可靠{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can trust your car to the system with the star.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.50,0:11:51.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,检查机油、检查起落架{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Checking oil. Checking landing gear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.14,0:11:55.62,Note,0,0,0,0,,（一路到底 大白鲨第十九集正在上映中）
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.22,0:12:08.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲨鱼仍旧不逼真{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The shark still looks fake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.64,0:12:10.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,朋友们 我是哥帝三世{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, friends. Goldie Wilson III{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.02,0:12:12.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,威尔逊系统转换公司{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}for Wilson Hover Conversion Systems.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.19,0:12:16.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我祖父做山谷镇市长时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, when my grandpa was mayor of Hill Valley, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.52,0:12:18.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要担心交通问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}he had to worry about traffic problems.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.98,0:12:21.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如今 你我都不用担心交通了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now, you don't have to worry about traffic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.82,0:12:24.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能把你的旧车…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll hover-convert your old road car{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.74,0:12:31.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,转变为飞行车 只要39 999.95元{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}into a skyway flier for only $39, 999.95.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.29,0:12:34.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来看看我 哥帝三世{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So come on down and see me, Goldie Wilson III, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.67,0:12:37.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们总共有二十九家分店 请来和我们详谈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}at any one of our 29 convenient locations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.92,0:12:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住 让旧车飞起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember, keep 'em flying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.14,0:12:42.06,Note,0,0,0,0,,（熨斗… 古董电脑…）
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.14,0:12:44.09,Note,0,0,0,0,,（1950-2000运动年鉴）
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.10,0:13:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是要青椒炒肉面饼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or fried meat pancake with green pepper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.53,0:13:05.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,是将辣番茄酱、鳄梨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's got a hot salsa, avocados, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.74,0:13:08.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,香菜 加在你所选择的豆子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}cilantro mixed with your choice of beans, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.58,0:13:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,鸡肉、牛肉或猪肉里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}chicken, beef or pork.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.24,0:13:13.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,服务生！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Waiter. Waiter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.51,0:13:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不要试试果馅卷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you like to try some rolls?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.71,0:13:18.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到80年代咖啡店{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to the Cafe '80s, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.42,0:13:22.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,在美国任何时间都是早上 即使是在下午{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}where it's always morning in America, even in the afternoon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.80,0:13:26.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天的特餐是烤豆寿司{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our special today is mesquite-grilled sushi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.43,0:13:28.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定要试人质特餐 是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must have the hostage special! Cajun style.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.85,0:13:30.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定要试人质特餐！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must have the hostage special!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.81,0:13:33.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定要试人质特餐！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must have the hostage special!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.89,0:13:37.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey, hey, guys! Hey, hey, guys!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.15,0:13:38.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只要瓶百事可乐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I want is a Pepsi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.19,0:13:45.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 马丁！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, McFly!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.99,0:13:49.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我常看到你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I've seen you around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.99,0:13:52.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是老马丁的儿子 对不对？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're Marty McFly's kid, aren't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.33,0:13:54.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝夫？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Biff?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.62,0:13:56.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是小马丁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're Marty Jr.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.87,0:13:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不容易呀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tough break, kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.08,0:14:01.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,和那个混蛋同名一定很痛苦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must be rough being named after a complete butthead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.13,0:14:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是什么意思？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that supposed to mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.59,0:14:04.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂！有人在家吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello? Hello? Anybody home?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.26,0:14:05.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.63,0:14:07.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你猪脑啊！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think, McFly, think!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.43,0:14:10.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你老爸是个笑柄？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your old man? Mr. Loser?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.76,0:14:11.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.80,0:14:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.35,0:14:15.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是一个大笑柄{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Loser with a capital "L."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.43,0:14:18.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道乔治不是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I happen to know George McFly is no longer a loser.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.90,0:14:20.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是在说乔治{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm not talking about George McFly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.77,0:14:22.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说他的儿子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm talking about his kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.44,0:14:26.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是你的老爸 马丁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your old man, Marty McFly Sr., {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.53,0:14:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他潦倒一辈子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the man who took his life{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.28,0:14:30.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,天天冲厕所{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and flushed it completely down the toilet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.28,0:14:33.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.62,0:14:36.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 他有吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean… I mean, he did?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.66,0:14:38.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,爷爷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Gramps, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.96,0:14:42.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你要打两层蜡 不是一层！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you two coats of wax on my car, not just one!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.59,0:14:45.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,上个礼拜我才打过第二层蜡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey, I just put the second coat on last week.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.67,0:14:47.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是闭着眼睛打吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah? With your eyes closed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.47,0:14:48.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们俩是亲戚吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you two related?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.63,0:14:52.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂！有人在家吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello? Hello? Anybody home?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.22,0:14:54.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你脑袋到哪儿去了 格里夫刚刚 不是叫我「爷爷」吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think, Griff just calls me "Grandpa" for his health?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.06,0:14:56.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他就是格里夫？- 爷爷 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's Griff? - Gramps!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.73,0:14:59.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不懂为什么要付你钱？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell am I paying you for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.98,0:15:02.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子 替我向你奶奶问好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, kid, say hello to your grandma for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.06,0:15:04.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,爷爷 你出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out here, Gramps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.52,0:15:06.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你别急嘛！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, take it easy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.94,0:15:11.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,马丁 你等着 哪儿都别去 下一个就是你！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, McFly, don't go anywhere! You're next!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.41,0:15:15.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是电动游戏机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a video game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.69,0:15:17.25,Note,0,0,0,0,,（西部枪手）
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.37,0:15:19.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我把它修好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it working.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.16,0:15:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸爸教过我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dad taught me about these.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.79,0:15:23.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是西部枪手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is Wild Gunman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.75,0:15:25.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,要怎么玩这个游戏？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you play this thing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.38,0:15:27.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我露两手给你们看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll show you, kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.13,0:15:30.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可是一流的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a crack shot at this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.80,0:15:35.92,Note,0,0,0,0,,（射击顶呱呱）
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.93,0:15:37.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,居然要用手去玩？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean you have to use your hands?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.52,0:15:39.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,简直是婴儿的玩具{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's like a baby's toy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.94,0:15:43.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,婴儿玩具？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baby's toy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.78,0:15:53.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,百事可乐 太好了 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pepsi Perfect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.20,0:15:55.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 糟糕 - 百事可乐 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Damn - Pepsi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.20,0:15:58.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 麦佛莱！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, McFly!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.20,0:16:02.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是叫你在里面等我吗！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought I told you to stay in here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.37,0:16:05.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,格里夫 你们好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Griff. Guys, how's it going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.75,0:16:08.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 麦佛莱 - 什么事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- McFly! - Yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.38,0:16:10.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 麦佛莱 - 什么事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- McFly! - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.92,0:16:12.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的鞋带松了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your shoe's unvelked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.60,0:16:23.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚的事你决定了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, McFly, have you made a decision about tonight's opportunity?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.31,0:16:25.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,格里夫 我实在不能确定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, Griff. You know, I was thinking about it. I'm not sure, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.36,0:16:26.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我认为{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}because I just think, you know, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.56,0:16:29.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这件事好像有点危险…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}it might be a little bit dangerous, so…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.73,0:16:31.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦佛莱 你怎么啦？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong, McFly?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.24,0:16:33.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有阴囊吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got no scrote?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.95,0:16:41.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他简直无能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a complete wimp.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.25,0:16:44.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底决定了没有？要不要参加？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's it gonna be, McFly? Are you in or out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.58,0:16:47.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还不能确定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just… I'm not sure that I should.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.63,0:16:50.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我想和我爸爸商量一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, because I think that I should discuss it with my father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.76,0:16:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爸爸？你爸爸？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your father? Your father?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.38,0:16:54.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,答错了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wrong answer, McFly! You lose!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.85,0:17:01.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我参加 不管你说什么我都会做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Griff, I'll do it. I'll do it, buddy. Whatever you say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.10,0:17:02.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,待在这里别出声{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay down and shut up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.27,0:17:05.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们俩继续骑 不准停下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep pedaling, you two!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.95,0:17:20.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 让我听听正确的答案{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, let's hear the right answer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.45,0:17:23.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.21,0:17:27.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么时候变狠啦？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since when did you become the physical type?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.21,0:17:28.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,答案是「不」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The answer's no, Griff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.46,0:17:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,「不」？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.59,0:17:31.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 你是聋了还是听不懂？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. What are you, deaf and stupid?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.80,0:17:33.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说「不」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.55,0:17:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么啦？胆小鬼？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong, McFly? Chicken?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.64,0:17:43.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫我什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you call me, Griff?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.14,0:17:47.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,胆小鬼！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chicken, McFly!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.40,0:17:50.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人敢叫我…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody calls me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.90,0:17:54.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,胆小鬼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}chicken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.41,0:18:06.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好 来呀 - 你们看！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right, punk! - Hey, look!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.93,0:18:24.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿 嘿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey, hey, hey, hey. Hey, hey, hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.35,0:18:26.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一等 小女孩！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop! Little girl, little girl. Stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.85,0:18:27.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Look, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.02,0:18:30.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想向你借盘旋板{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to borrow your Hoverboard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.27,0:18:32.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在哪里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.65,0:18:33.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.53,0:18:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.03,0:18:43.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在盘旋板上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's on a Hoverboard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.45,0:18:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿出盘旋板！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the boards!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.79,0:18:49.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,去抓马丁！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get McFly!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.30,0:18:57.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,去抓他！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.22,0:19:08.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那里！我们赶上他了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah! Yeah, we got him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.15,0:19:21.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都那么熟悉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's something very familiar about all this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.81,0:19:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 你这个笨蛋！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, McFly, you bojo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.98,0:19:58.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,板子不能在水上走！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those boards don't work on water!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.94,0:20:00.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非你有动力！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless you've got power!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.64,0:20:27.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,钩起来！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hook on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.50,0:20:32.06,Note,0,0,0,0,,（比特斗牛犬）
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.94,0:20:38.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始作战！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Batter up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.72,0:21:09.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.39,0:21:15.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,一群笨蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buttheads.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.83,0:21:18.76,Note,0,0,0,0,,（法院大楼）
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.99,0:21:31.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,「干燥程式开始」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drying mode on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.16,0:21:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,「烘干夹克」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jacket drying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.21,0:21:37.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,「你的夹克已干」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your jacket is now dry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.71,0:21:43.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 小女孩 谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, kid. Hey, little girl, thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.21,0:21:45.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你留着 我有比特斗牛犬{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep it. I got a Pit Bull now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.80,0:21:46.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.01,0:21:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,拯救钟塔！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Save the clock tower!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.39,0:21:50.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,捐点钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, kid. Throw in 100 bucks, will you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.64,0:21:52.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,来拯救钟塔吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and help save the clock tower.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.81,0:21:54.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我…对不起 不行 - 帮帮忙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sorry, no. - Come on, kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.31,0:21:55.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是历史上重要的里程碑！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's an important historical landmark!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.89,0:21:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,以后吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, some other time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.19,0:21:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,它在六十年前被闪电击中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lightning struck that thing 60 years ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.98,0:22:03.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,芝加哥小熊队得到世界冠军{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute. Cubs win World Series.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.11,0:22:06.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,胜过迈阿密队？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Against Miami?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.24,0:22:07.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 太出人意料了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it's something, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.74,0:22:10.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁料得到？这是一百比一呀！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who would've thought? 100-1 shot!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.37,0:22:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,真希望能回到过去开赛前{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish I could go back to the beginning of the season, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.04,0:22:14.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,好在小熊队身上下注{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}put some money on the Cubs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.33,0:22:16.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说迈阿密…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just meant that Miami…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.58,0:22:18.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚刚说什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you just say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.96,0:22:21.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说真希望能回到过去开赛前{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said I wish I could go back to the beginning of the season.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.46,0:22:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,好在小熊队身上下注！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put some money on the Cubbies!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.05,0:22:31.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这本书很有意思 外面还有封套（1950-2000运动年鉴）{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now this has an interesting feature. It has a dust jacket.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.22,0:22:33.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,作用是保护书本{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Books used to have these to protect the covers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.60,0:22:35.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这当然是在防尘纸发明以前{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, that was before they had dust-repellent paper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.35,0:22:37.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你喜欢灰尘{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you're interested in dust, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.06,0:22:40.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有古雅的 1980年代的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we have a quaint little piece from the 1980s.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.02,0:22:42.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,吸尘器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's called a DustBuster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.65,0:22:49.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要发大财了 - 马丁！在上面！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can't lose. - Marty! Marty! Up here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.45,0:22:51.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士 怎么样了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Doc, what's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.82,0:22:53.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你等着 我会停到你那里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand by. I'll park over there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.33,0:22:55.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.96,0:22:59.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间正好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, right on time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.92,0:23:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞行的迪罗里安车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flying DeLorean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.58,0:23:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,有三十年没见过了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't seen one of those in 30 years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.17,0:23:06.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. Excuse me. Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.97,0:23:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 开车看路行不行！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I'm walking here! I'm walking here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.72,0:23:12.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.80,0:23:16.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,要开车就别吃镇定剂 讨厌！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't drive, trank, low-res scuzzball!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.18,0:23:18.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么会有两个他？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two of them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.02,0:23:21.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我让他不省人事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I left him in a suspended animation kennel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.31,0:23:22.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,就连爱因斯坦也搞不清状况！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Einstein never knew I was gone!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.94,0:23:28.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天 这里到底发生了什么事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marty! What in the name of Sir Isaac H. Newton happened here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.57,0:23:31.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我儿子出现 搞得乱七八糟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah, Doc, listen, my kid showed up. All hell broke loose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.03,0:23:33.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你儿子？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your kid?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.66,0:23:37.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟糕！是安眠感应器 我好怕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great Scott, the sleep inducer. I was afraid of this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.20,0:23:38.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为先用在詹妮弗身上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I used it on Jennifer, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.50,0:23:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以剩下来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}there wasn't enough power left{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.58,0:23:42.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不够让你儿子睡足一个钟头 糟糕！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to knock your son out for a full hour. Damn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.17,0:23:44.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士 你看！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doc, Doc, Doc, look at this!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.50,0:23:46.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,它在改变{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's changing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.72,0:23:50.05,Note,0,0,0,0,,（青年小马丁因偷窃被捕）
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.15,0:23:52.57,Note,0,0,0,0,,（阿飞党被拘留 盘旋板冲撞毁坏法院大楼）
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.68,0:24:00.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是被人陷害的！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was framed!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.02,0:24:04.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 这就对了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes! Yes, of course!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.23,0:24:07.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,由于盘旋板事件的发生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because this Hoverboard incident has now occurred, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.57,0:24:09.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,格里夫进了监牢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Griff now goes to jail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.53,0:24:11.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你儿子就不会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Therefore, your son won't go with him tonight, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.11,0:24:12.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,和他去偷东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that robbery will never take place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.07,0:24:15.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,如此一来 未来的历史…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thus, history, future history, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.03,0:24:18.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,被改写了 这就是证明！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}has now been altered, and this is the proof!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.49,0:24:20.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们成功了 虽然和我计划不同 管他的！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marty, we've succeeded, not exactly as I planned, but no matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.91,0:24:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们去找詹妮弗然后回家！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go get Jennifer and go home!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.46,0:24:27.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 爱因斯坦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Einie. Hi, buddy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.00,0:24:30.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.21,0:24:31.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,纪念品{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a souvenir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.42,0:24:33.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,「五十年的运动统计资料」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"50 years of sports statistics."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.80,0:24:36.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,根本就没有娱乐性{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hardly recreational reading material, Marty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.14,0:24:37.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士 把未来的资讯带回去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, hey, Doc, what's the harm{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.22,0:24:39.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么不对？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in bringing back a little info on the future?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.52,0:24:41.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,说不定还能赌上几把{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, maybe we could place a couple bets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.64,0:24:45.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,马丁 我发明时光机不是为了赚钱！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marty, I didn't invent the time machine for financial gain!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.73,0:24:48.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是为了能够更透彻的观察人性{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The intent here is to gain a clearer perception of humanity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.52,0:24:49.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的所做、所为{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where we've been, where we're going, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.03,0:24:53.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,陷阱与可能性、危险与圈套{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the pitfalls and the possibilities, the perils and the promise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.28,0:24:56.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至希望能找到探讨宇宙「为什么」的答案{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps even an answer to that universal question, "Why?"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.66,0:24:58.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士 我完全同意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Doc, I'm all for that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.91,0:25:01.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,但顺便赚点钱有什么不好？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong with making a few bucks on the side?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.50,0:25:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要把它丢到垃圾桶去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am going to put this in the trash.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.92,0:25:08.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great Scott!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.76,0:25:16.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹妮弗住在山谷市 橡树街3793号{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}McFly, Jennifer Jane Parker, 3793 Oakhurst Street, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.09,0:25:17.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,四十七岁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hilldale, age 47.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.72,0:25:20.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,四十七岁？整容整得太棒了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forty-seven? That's a hell of a good face-lift.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.72,0:25:21.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们在做什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are they doing, Doc?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.97,0:25:23.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们用指纹核对她的身份{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They used her thumbprint to assess her ID.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.02,0:25:25.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然指纹不变{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since her thumbprint never changes over the years, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.73,0:25:27.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们就把她当成未来的詹妮弗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}they simply assume she's the Jennifer of the future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.94,0:25:29.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得去阻止她们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we gotta stop them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.23,0:25:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么开口？告诉她们我们在做时光旅行吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we gonna say? That we're time travelers?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.98,0:25:32.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们会把我们抓起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'd have us committed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.32,0:25:34.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,她没前科 把她送回家吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's clean. That means we take her home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.78,0:25:36.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,去山谷市？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Home? To Hilldale?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.11,0:25:38.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,到那里天都黑了 只好如此{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lt'll be dark by the time we get out there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.16,0:25:41.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们要把她送回你未来的家！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it. They're taking her home to your future home!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.62,0:25:42.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在她们之后到达{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll arrive shortly thereafter, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.91,0:25:44.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到她 就回到1985年{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}get her out of there and go back to 1985.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.00,0:25:46.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么我可以看到我住在哪里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean I'm gonna see where I live?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.33,0:25:47.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,和我老了是什么样子？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna see myself as an old man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.96,0:25:51.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 那会引起…我的天！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, Marty. That could result in… Great Scott!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.55,0:25:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹妮弗一定会遇到 未来的自己！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jennifer could conceivably encounter her future self!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.38,0:25:57.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,后果可能会不可收拾！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The consequences of that could be disastrous!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.51,0:25:58.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士 你在说什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doc, what do you mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.80,0:26:00.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我预见两种可能性{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I foresee two possibilities.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.35,0:26:02.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一 看到三十年后的自己{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One, coming face to face with herself 30 years older{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.93,0:26:05.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,会让她吓昏过去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}would put her into shock, and she'd simply pass out, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.14,0:26:07.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是第二 会遭遇时间冲突{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}or two, the encounter could create a time paradox, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.90,0:26:10.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,而导致破坏时空的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the results of which could cause a chain reaction that would unravel{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.65,0:26:12.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,连锁反应{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the very fabric of the space-time continuum{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.40,0:26:14.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,进而摧毁整个宇宙！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and destroy the entire universe!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.74,0:26:16.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是最坏的假设{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Granted, that's a worst-case scenario.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.53,0:26:18.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,毁灭也许是局部性{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The destruction might, in fact, be very localized, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.24,0:26:20.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,只限于我们自己的银河系{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}limited to merely our own galaxy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.37,0:26:23.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,那叫我放心不少{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's a relief.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.16,0:26:30.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 希望我们能 在她找到自己之前找到她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go. I sure hope we find Jennifer before she finds herself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.93,0:26:32.36,Note,0,0,0,0,,（C25航线有偏移）
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.46,0:26:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,航线堵塞了 要开很久才能到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The skyway's jammed. It's gonna take us forever to get there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.71,0:26:37.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,不准带它走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this stays here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.30,0:26:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发明时光机 不是用来赌博的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't invent the time machine to win at gambling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.39,0:26:41.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,是用它来穿梭时光岁月的！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I invented a time machine to travel through time!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.85,0:26:43.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 我知道 我知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. I know. I know, Doc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.07,0:26:57.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,布朗博士居然发明了时光机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Doc Brown invented a time machine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.84,0:27:08.47,Note,0,0,0,0,,（山谷警察）
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.54,0:27:09.97,Note,0,0,0,0,,（山谷市）
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.89,0:27:25.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,山谷市{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hilldale.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.39,0:27:30.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个镇定剂、流氓滋生的地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing but a breeding ground for tranks, lobos and zipheads.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.31,0:27:32.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,真该把这地方拆掉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, they ought to tear this whole place down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.65,0:27:36.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹妮弗 欢迎回家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome home, Jennifer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.65,0:27:39.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧？- 没事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You all right? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.11,0:27:41.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你体内有点镇定剂 但应该能够走路{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a little tranked, but I think you can walk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.95,0:27:43.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,夫人 你应该重新调整程式{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ma'am, you should reprogram.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.57,0:27:45.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,进门不开灯很危险{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's dangerous to enter without lights on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.58,0:27:46.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,开灯？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lights on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.62,0:27:47.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 听着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Now, look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.79,0:27:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你休息一下就没问题了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just take it easy and you'll be fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.42,0:27:53.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,将来要小心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And be careful in the future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.08,0:27:55.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,将来？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The future?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.88,0:27:58.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦佛莱太太 祝你有个愉快的一天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have a nice day, Mrs. McFly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.68,0:28:05.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,全天播出美丽的视野{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Broadcasting beautiful views 24 hours a day, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.18,0:28:07.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你正在收看风景频道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're tuned to the Scenery Channel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.77,0:28:14.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是在未来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in the future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.16,0:28:27.07,Note,0,0,0,0,,（爱的礼拜堂）
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.12,0:28:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我居然在爱的礼拜堂结婚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get married in the Chapel O Love?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.04,0:28:32.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈 是你吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom? Mom, is that you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.54,0:28:34.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得赶快离开这里！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta get out of here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.21,0:28:40.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.31,0:28:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈 是你吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom? Mom, is that you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.48,0:28:57.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,奶奶！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grandma Lorraine!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.61,0:28:58.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,甜心！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweetheart!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.65,0:28:59.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 嗨！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi! Hi!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.90,0:29:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,爷爷怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to Grandpa?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.98,0:29:02.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他背痛的毛病又犯了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, he threw his back out again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.82,0:29:04.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,爷爷的甜心好不好？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's Granddad's little pumpkin?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.86,0:29:06.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,爷爷 你是怎么搞的？他是怎么搞的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you do that? How did he do that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.32,0:29:08.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,打高尔夫球不小心弄到的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, out on the golf course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.83,0:29:09.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爸妈回来了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are your folks home yet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.99,0:29:11.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我带比萨饼来请大家吃{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I brought pizza for everyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.75,0:29:12.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁会吃嘛？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, who's going to eat all that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.83,0:29:13.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.08,0:29:15.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,交通真挤！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn this traffic!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.00,0:29:17.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹妮弗通常是这时候到家的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jennifer, that is Old Jennifer, usually gets home around now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.00,0:29:19.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望我们没太迟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope we're not too late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.51,0:29:24.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士 怎么啦？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it? What's the matter, Doc?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.84,0:29:27.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好像看到出租车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For a moment, I thought I saw a taxi in my rear display.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.51,0:29:29.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,貌似在跟踪我们 天呀 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought it was following us. Weird.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.18,0:29:32.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这扇窗子怎么仍是破的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe this window's still broken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.02,0:29:35.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,当修理工叫爸爸胆小鬼时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, when the scenescreen repairman called Daddy a chicken, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.85,0:29:37.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸就把他丢出去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy threw him out of the house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.52,0:29:39.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在再也找不到人来修了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, we can't get anybody to fix it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.61,0:29:41.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看坏成这个样子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, look how worn out this is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.99,0:29:45.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,马琳 你爸爸最大的毛病就是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your father's biggest problem, Marlene, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.53,0:29:47.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,别人一叫他胆小鬼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}is that he loses all self-control{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.53,0:29:49.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就控制不住自己{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}when someone calls him chicken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.49,0:29:51.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔治 我们听他说过多少次？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many times have we heard it, George?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.37,0:29:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,「妈 我不能让人以为我是胆小鬼」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Mom, I can't let them think I'm chicken."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.29,0:29:54.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,「不能让人以为我是胆小鬼」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Can't let them think I'm chicken."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.04,0:29:57.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一点也没错！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right. Well, you're right!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.37,0:29:58.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,三十年前{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}About 30 years ago, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.88,0:30:00.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爸爸为了证明他不是胆小鬼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}your father tried to prove he wasn't chicken, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.00,0:30:03.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果发生那次车祸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he ended up in an automobile accident.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.26,0:30:04.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是和劳斯莱斯相撞那一次？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you mean with the Rolls-Royce?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.97,0:30:07.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,车祸？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Automobile accident.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.77,0:30:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱因斯坦 我们去找詹妮弗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Einie, let's find Jennifer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.32,0:30:23.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不敢相信 我住在山谷市{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't believe it. I live in Hilldale?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.94,0:30:25.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 挺不错的嘛！- 走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is great! - Way to go, McFly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.57,0:30:27.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,马丁 你留在这里换衣服{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marty, stay here. Just change clothes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.57,0:30:28.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要你时我会叫你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I need you, I'll holler.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.66,0:30:30.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想去看我的房子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Doc, I wanna check out my house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.41,0:30:32.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可能会碰到未来的自己{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't risk you running into your older self.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.41,0:30:34.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱因斯坦 我们走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Einie, let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.33,0:30:36.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹妮弗在哪里？詹妮弗在哪里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Jennifer? Where's Jennifer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.83,0:30:38.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,山谷市{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hilldale.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.46,0:30:40.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is bitching.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.67,0:30:49.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,一百七十四块五毛钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One, seven, four point five zero.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.47,0:30:50.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,一共是一百七十四块五毛钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That will be $174.50.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.93,0:30:52.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.18,0:30:53.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心点 这里很不安全{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd be careful, old timer. This is a rough neighborhood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.01,0:30:55.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 收据呢？- 在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where's my receipt? - Right here. Here it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.89,0:30:58.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,有没有小费？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello. Hello. How about a tip?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.44,0:31:12.57,Note,0,0,0,0,,（垃圾回收站）
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.66,0:31:14.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是那个车祸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That accident caused a chain reaction{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.70,0:31:16.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,毁了他这一生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that sent Marty's life straight down the tubes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.87,0:31:18.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则你爸爸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If not for that accident, your father's life{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.96,0:31:20.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,会很不同{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}would have turned out very differently.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.79,0:31:22.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有劳斯莱斯的车主 要求他赔偿损失{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The man in the Rolls-Royce wouldn't have pressed charges, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.96,0:31:24.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,马丁就不会伤了手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marty wouldn't have broken his hand, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.21,0:31:25.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,而放弃他的音乐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he wouldn't have given up on his music, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.05,0:31:28.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,从此以后生活在自怨自艾之中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he wouldn't have spent all those years feeling sorry for himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.05,0:31:30.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈 裤子很好看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Mom, nice pants.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.72,0:31:33.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妈会和他结婚主要的原因{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think the real reason your mother married him was because{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.80,0:31:35.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 「妈」？- 是因为她可怜你爸爸 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- "Mom"? - she felt sorry for him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.10,0:31:37.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,她真是个好孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Such a sweet girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.47,0:31:39.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 关掉美术画面 - 也许她应该…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Art off. - I think maybe she deserves…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.48,0:31:44.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要18、24、63、109、87 和气象频道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I want channels 18, 24, 63, 109, 87 and the Weather Channel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.82,0:31:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,气象频道 带给你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Weather Channel, bringing you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.48,0:31:47.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,每天24小时的气象资讯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the world's weather 24 hours a day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.03,0:31:50.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,天前还是老样子…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weather conditions remain the same…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.15,0:31:51.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有注册整容医生…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All board-certified implant surgeons…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.91,0:31:53.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,稍微回暖…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}With a minor warm front…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.49,0:31:55.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,马丁 欢迎回家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome home, Marty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.16,0:31:57.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨！爸爸回家了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey, hey. Dad's home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.58,0:32:00.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 我回家了 爸爸回家了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right. He's home. Dad's home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.25,0:32:02.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,贵族的庄园 哈罗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lord of the manor. Hello. Hello.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.25,0:32:03.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,国王的城堡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}King of the castle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.38,0:32:04.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈罗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.04,0:32:07.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.01,0:32:10.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,生活程式开始{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lithium mode on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.22,0:32:12.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,好多了 这些小鬼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. That's better. Damned kids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.05,0:32:14.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 儿子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.56,0:32:18.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么换成看小电视？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watching a little TV for a change?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.07,0:32:32.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.99,0:33:14.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,比萨饼 饿死了 （必胜客）{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, pizza. I'm hungry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.36,0:33:15.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,别急{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Just wait your turn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.61,0:33:16.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,热好的时候{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grandma, when it's ready, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.74,0:33:18.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,能不能塞到我嘴里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}could you just shove it in my mouth?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.49,0:33:21.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的玩笑一点也不好笑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you be a smartass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.12,0:33:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了 这是残酷频道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, great! The Atrocity Channel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.08,0:33:24.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,水合程度四{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hydrate level 4, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.13,0:33:33.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it ready?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.47,0:33:35.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here you go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.09,0:33:36.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇！妈妈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, boy. Oh, boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.26,0:33:39.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的水合比萨饼真好吃{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom, you sure can hydrate a pizza.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.14,0:33:41.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 怎么回事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. I missed that whole thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.35,0:33:45.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是担心詹妮弗 她怎么还没回家？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm just worried about Jennifer. Why isn't she home yet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.56,0:33:49.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道詹妮弗到哪去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not sure where Jennifer is, Mom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.19,0:33:51.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,她几个钟头前就应该到家的 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She should have been home hours ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.27,0:33:52.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,最近我也不知道她的行踪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm having a hard time keeping track of her these days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.94,0:33:55.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,来点水果？水果 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, fruit. Fruit, please. Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.74,0:33:57.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,她好像又在闹情绪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's in one of those moods, I guess. I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.82,0:33:59.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和詹妮弗之间出问题了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aren't you and Jennifer getting along?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.57,0:34:00.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah. Great, Mom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.91,0:34:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像年轻时候一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're more like a couple of teenagers, you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.43,0:34:05.35,Note,0,0,0,0,,（电话）
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.71,0:34:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 是尼德的电话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, telephone. It's Needles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.29,0:34:09.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 找你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, it's for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.79,0:34:13.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我到书房去接{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Well, I'll take that in the den. Excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.80,0:34:15.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,收回！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Retract.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.76,0:34:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 我在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello. I'm in here, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.47,0:34:23.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 马丁 近来如何？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, the big M. How's it hanging, McFly?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.52,0:34:25.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 尼德{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Needles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.73,0:34:26.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼德？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Needles?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.94,0:34:29.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有没有看我的企划书？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, did you take look at that little business proposal of mine?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.40,0:34:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, Needles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.69,0:34:32.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怕什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you afraid of?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.32,0:34:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果成功了 就能解决你的财务困难{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If this thing works, it'll solve all your financial problems.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.99,0:34:39.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果不成 我会被解雇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if it doesn't work, Needles, I could get fired.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.20,0:34:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是非法的 说不定富士通正在监视{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's illegal. I mean, what if the Jits is monitoring, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.12,0:34:45.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不会发现的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Jits will never find out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.33,0:34:46.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔 天呀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.50,0:34:51.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样嘛！把卡放在卡槽里 其余由我来处理{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Stick your card in the slot, and I'll handle it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.75,0:34:55.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非你要大家都认为 你是个胆小鬼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless you want everyone in the division to think you're chicken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.39,0:35:03.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人叫我胆小鬼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody calls me chicken, Needles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.72,0:35:04.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.81,0:35:05.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.81,0:35:08.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,证明呀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prove it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.56,0:35:14.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.57,0:35:16.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼德 你赢了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Needles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.74,0:35:23.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的卡 正在扫瞄 你满意了吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's my card. Scan it. I'm in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.58,0:35:26.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 马丁 明天工厂见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, McFly. I'll see you at the plant tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.64,0:35:29.52,Note,0,0,0,0,,（谢谢使用美国电报电话）
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.62,0:35:30.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,胆小鬼 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chicken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.71,0:35:34.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,马丁！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}McFly!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.16,0:35:37.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊藤富士通 富士通先生 晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.55,0:35:42.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在监视 你刚刚所做的扫瞄{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}McFly, I was monitoring that scan you just interfaced.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.14,0:35:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你被解雇了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are terminated!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.89,0:35:45.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,解雇 不要！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Terminated. No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.22,0:35:47.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是我的错 是尼德的错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! It wasn't my fault, sir. It was Needles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.47,0:35:48.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼德是幕后人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Needles was behind the whole thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.60,0:35:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你和他合作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you cooperated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.73,0:35:51.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 我没有 这是例行程序。- 这是违法的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, I didn't. It was a sting operation. - It was illegal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.94,0:35:53.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在骗他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was setting him up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.31,0:35:54.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,看我的传真！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you knew. McFly, read my fax!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.07,0:35:59.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,求求你不要开除我 不要这样做 我被开除了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Please, no. I cannot be fired. I'm fired.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.29,0:36:07.65,Note,0,0,0,0,,（你被开除了）
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.41,0:36:12.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这太严重了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, this is heavy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.75,0:36:16.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要怎么对詹妮弗说？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What am I going to tell Jennifer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.42,0:36:18.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹妮弗 詹妮弗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jennifer. Jennifer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.42,0:36:20.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士 我真高兴看到你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Doc, am I glad to see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.26,0:36:24.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,从前门出去 我在那里等你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go out the front door. I'll meet you there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.43,0:36:26.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有门把 门打不开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it doesn't open. There's no doorknob.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.01,0:36:29.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,用拇指按金属板{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Press your thumb to the plate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.31,0:36:31.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么金属板？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What plate?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.28,0:36:47.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个传真是什么意思？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marty, what does this fax mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.41,0:36:50.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是公司开的玩笑 是一种玩笑传真{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Mom, it's a joke, an office joke. Kind of a joke fax.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.62,0:36:51.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,马丁 我听到你在叫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marty, I heard you yelling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.96,0:36:53.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈 你别紧张{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom, Mom, Mom, calm down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.83,0:36:56.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有叫 尼德和我在闹着玩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wasn't yelling. Needles and I were just kind of joking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.21,0:36:57.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹妮弗 欢迎回家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome home, Jennifer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.42,0:36:58.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,马丁 你失业了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marty, have you lost your job?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.50,0:37:01.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,失业 妈 你想到那里去了…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lost my job, Mom? Get out of town. Look, you know…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.84,0:37:07.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我这么年轻！- 我这么老！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm young! - I'm old!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.15,0:37:18.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,马丁 马丁！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marty! Marty!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.82,0:37:20.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,马丁 快来！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marty, come quick! Quick!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.50,0:37:37.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,她见到未来的自己后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She encountered her older self{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.92,0:37:40.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,昏倒了 就如我所预测的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and went into shock, just as I predicted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.55,0:37:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不会有事的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'll be fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.09,0:37:44.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,快把她送回1985年{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get her back to 1985, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.34,0:37:47.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后就毁灭这部时光机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then I'm gonna destroy the time machine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.22,0:37:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,毁灭它？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Destroy it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.39,0:37:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那怎么去洞察人性{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about that stuff about humanity, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.18,0:37:51.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,和找出「为什么」的解答？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}where we're going and why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.89,0:37:54.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,冒的危险太大了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The risks are just too great, as this incident proves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.52,0:37:55.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须负起这个责任{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I was behaving responsibly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.85,0:37:57.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能想象{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can imagine the danger{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.23,0:37:59.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,时光机落入坏人之手 的后果会怎样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}if the time machine were to fall into the wrong hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.53,0:38:04.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我唯一的遗憾 是没法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My only regret is that I'll never get a chance{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.95,0:38:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,去我最喜欢的年代{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to visit my favorite historical era, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.61,0:38:09.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,旧西部{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Old West.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.41,0:38:13.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,但时光旅行实在太危险了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But time traveling is just too dangerous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.24,0:38:16.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是专心研究{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better that I devote myself to studying{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.25,0:38:19.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,宇宙中其他难解的迷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the other great mystery of the universe, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.50,0:38:22.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是女人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}women.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.71,0:38:28.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,马丁、爱因斯坦 准备暂时时间转移{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marty, Einie, brace yourselves for temporal displacement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.77,0:38:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们成功了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did we make it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.32,0:38:45.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们回去了没有？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.53,0:38:53.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们回来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.47,0:39:15.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,先把她放在吊椅上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's put her in the swing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.93,0:39:17.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我送你回家 等会儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I'll take you home, and you can come back{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.31,0:39:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你再开车来叫醒她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in your truck and wake her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.31,0:39:21.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,等她醒过来 天又这么晚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When she awakens here in her own house and it's dark, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.86,0:39:24.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就比较容易说服她 那是一场梦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you should be able to convince her that it was all a dream.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.69,0:39:25.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 我们就这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute. We're just gonna{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.94,0:39:27.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,把她留在门廊上？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}leave her here on the porch?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.53,0:39:30.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,迷惘会帮你说服她 这是一场梦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The disorientation will help convince her that it was all a dream.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.86,0:39:32.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,她还会睡多久？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long do you think she's gonna be out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.82,0:39:35.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,不清楚 她受到的打击不小{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not quite sure. She received quite a shock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.45,0:39:36.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能几分钟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could be for a few minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.75,0:39:39.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,也可能几小时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most probably, a couple of hours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.16,0:39:40.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好把嗅盐带来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You better bring smelling salts back with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.96,0:39:42.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,听你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the doc, Doc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.33,0:39:43.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 爱因斯坦 我们走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Come on. Let's go, Einie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.17,0:39:48.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,放心 她不会有事的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry. She'll be fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.30,0:39:52.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,窗上怎么会有铁条{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't remember bars being on these windows.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.15,0:39:56.07,Note,0,0,0,0,,（里昂地产）
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.69,0:40:11.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果要找我 我会在实验室里拆这玩意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you need me, I'll be back at my lab dismantling this thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.86,0:40:13.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.42,0:40:32.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.94,0:40:51.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 等等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Hey, wait. Wait a minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.74,0:40:53.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在我房间干什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing in my room?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.53,0:40:54.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈 强暴！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help! Rape! Mom!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.70,0:40:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.78,0:40:57.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸 救命！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.37,0:40:58.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,混蛋 不准动！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freeze, sucker!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.66,0:41:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他爬到我身上 - 没事的 我不是来找麻烦的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He jumped me! - Hey, it's okay. I don't want any trouble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.29,0:41:01.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他破窗而入！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He came through the window!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.37,0:41:03.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个小混混 你麻烦大了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got trouble now, you piece of trash.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.87,0:41:05.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你找我女儿干嘛？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing in here with my daughter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.29,0:41:06.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我进错了房子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, listen, I'm just in the wrong house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.75,0:41:09.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是进错了房子 你这个混…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got that right, you little son of a…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.71,0:41:10.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做错了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, look, I made a mistake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.01,0:41:13.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 你是大错特错！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn right you made a mistake!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.80,0:41:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,宰了他！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.88,0:41:16.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要把你碎尸万段！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna tear your ass up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.80,0:41:18.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑呀！有本事就跑！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right. You keep running, sucker!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.01,0:41:20.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉那个房地产公司{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you tell that realty company{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.39,0:41:21.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会卖房子的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I ain't selling! You hear?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.02,0:41:23.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们吓不了我们！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We ain't gonna be terrorized!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.10,0:42:08.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定是搞错年代了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This has gotta be the wrong year.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.62,0:42:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,1985年？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}1985?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.54,0:42:30.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It can't be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.67,0:42:31.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,把报纸放下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.47,0:42:38.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是偷报纸的小混蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're the son of a bitch who's been stealing my newspapers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.30,0:42:39.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,史特兰老师{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Strickland.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.22,0:42:42.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,史特兰老师 是我 我是马丁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Strickland. It's me, sir. It's Marty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.76,0:42:43.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.85,0:42:45.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,马丁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Marty McFly. Marty McFly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.14,0:42:46.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你学校的学生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you know me, sir? From school, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.81,0:42:48.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从没看过你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never seen you before in my life, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.14,0:42:49.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看来就是个懒鬼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you look to me like a slacker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.94,0:42:52.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 我爱偷懒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's right. That's right. I am a slacker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.32,0:42:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得吗？上星期你还罚过我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you remember? You gave me detention last week.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.48,0:42:57.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,上星期？学校六年前就被烧毁了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last week? The school burned down six years ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.32,0:42:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,限你三分钟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you got exactly three seconds{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.49,0:43:00.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,离开我家 否则让你生不如死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to get off my porch with your nuts intact.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.16,0:43:02.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一 - 不要 史特兰老师{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- One. - Please, Mr. Strickland, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.16,0:43:03.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想知道到底出了什么事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want to know what the hell's going on here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.70,0:43:04.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,二{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.87,0:43:06.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 姓史的！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Strickland!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.60,0:43:27.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,赏你们子弹吃！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eat lead, slackers!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.14,0:43:32.50,Note,0,0,0,0,,（欢迎光临山谷市 居家的好地方）
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.44,0:43:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,走路看路行不行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch where you're going, crazy drunk pedestrian.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.86,0:43:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞德{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Red.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.38,0:43:48.80,Note,0,0,0,0,,（贝夫极乐天堂 贝夫添南博物馆）
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.55,0:43:53.21,Note,0,0,0,0,,（贝夫的家）
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.52,0:44:16.93,Note,0,0,0,0,,（地狱奇景）
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.52,0:44:23.71,Note,0,0,0,0,,（坦尼娅异国性爱 骨头）
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.62,0:44:29.24,Note,0,0,0,0,,（有毒工业废料开垦区）
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.35,0:44:36.44,Note,0,0,0,0,,（赌场）
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.54,0:44:38.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位先生女士们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies and gentlemen, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.17,0:44:40.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到贝夫添南博物馆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}welcome to the Biff Tannen Museum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.76,0:44:43.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个 献身于山谷镇的居民{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dedicated to Hill Valley's number one citizen{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.43,0:44:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,也是美国的民间英雄{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and America's greatest living folk hero, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.93,0:44:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就是独一无二的贝夫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the one and only Biff Tannen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.10,0:44:52.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都听过他的传奇 但没有切身体会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, we've all heard the legend, but who is the man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.85,0:44:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,在馆内你将得知{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Inside, you will learn{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.19,0:44:55.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位幸运儿是如何成为{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}how Biff Tannen became one of the richest{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.90,0:44:58.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,美国最有钱有势的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and most powerful men in America.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.27,0:45:00.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及这个家族的辉煌历史{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Learn the amazing history of the Tannen family, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.03,0:45:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他祖父就是疯狗布夫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}starting with his great-grandfather, Buford "Mad Dog" Tannen, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.49,0:45:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,西部第一快枪手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}fastest gun in the West.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.28,0:45:07.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝夫出生卑微{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See Biff's humble beginnings{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.87,0:45:09.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,当他二十一岁生日时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and how a trip to the racetrack{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.54,0:45:13.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,到赛马场赢得百万的财富{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}on his 21 st birthday made him a millionaire overnight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.76,0:45:16.67,Note,0,0,0,0,,（山谷镇居民赛马场大获全胜）
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.67,0:45:19.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,手气好得难以置信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Share in the excitement of a fabulous winning streak{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.50,0:45:23.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他因此获得「世界最幸运的人」的绰号{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that earned him the nickname "The Luckiest Man on Earth."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.38,0:45:25.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,更可得知他如何利用好运气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Learn how Biff parlayed that lucky winning streak{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.05,0:45:28.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,建立起 贝夫可这个庞大的王国{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}into the vast empire called Biffco.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.30,0:45:32.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及他如何在1979年 成功的游说赌博合法化{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Discover how in 1979, Biff successfully lobbied to legalize gambling{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.85,0:45:35.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,并将山谷镇 快倒塌的法院大楼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and turned Hill Valley's dilapidated courthouse{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.60,0:45:38.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,转变成美丽的赌场旅馆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}into a beautiful casino hotel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.31,0:45:42.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想说一件事：天佑美国！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want to say one thing. God bless America!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.99,0:45:45.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,见一见他热爱过的女人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meet the women who shared in his passion{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.15,0:45:46.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,和他寻觅多时的真爱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}as he searched for true love, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.70,0:45:49.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,并重新体验 贝夫最快乐的一刻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and relive Biff's happiest moment{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.49,0:45:53.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,在1973年他终于和相爱多年的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}as, in 1973, he realized his life-long romantic dream{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.16,0:45:56.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,高中恋人洛莲结婚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}by marrying his high school sweetheart, Lorraine Baines McFly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.21,0:45:57.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,结婚的感觉怎么样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's it feel, Mr. Tannen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.33,0:45:58.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,事不过三{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Third time's the charm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.75,0:46:06.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.22,0:46:07.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和我们到楼上去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you're coming with us upstairs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.55,0:46:08.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我走！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.68,0:46:11.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以来硬的 也可以来软的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, sonny, we can do this the easy way or the hard way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.76,0:46:13.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,来软的吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The easy way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.19,0:46:23.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈？妈 是你吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom? Mom, is that you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.36,0:46:24.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,马丁 你别紧张{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just relax, Marty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.74,0:46:28.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你睡了将近两个钟头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been asleep for almost two hours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.45,0:46:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做了一个很恐怖的梦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had a horrible nightmare. It was terrible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.16,0:46:37.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,别怕 这里非常安全{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you're safe and sound now, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.46,0:46:40.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在是在二十七楼的家里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}back on the good old 27th floor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.00,0:46:42.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,二十七楼！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twenty-seventh floor!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.55,0:46:51.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈 那不可能是你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom? Mom, that can't be you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.14,0:46:55.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我 马丁 你没事吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, yes, it's me, Marty. Are you all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.22,0:46:59.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很好 只是你怎么会…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine. I'm fine. It's just that you're so… You're so{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.15,0:47:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}big.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.02,0:47:04.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都会好转的 你饿不饿？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Everything's gonna be fine, Marty. Are you hungry?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.57,0:47:06.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以叫客房服务送吃的来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can call room service.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.24,0:47:09.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,客房服务？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Room service?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.66,0:47:11.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛莲！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lorraine!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.41,0:47:12.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟糕 是你父亲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God. It's your father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.08,0:47:14.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父亲？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.33,0:47:19.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个小混蛋 你现在应该在瑞士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're supposed to be in Switzerland, you little son of a bitch!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.17,0:47:20.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.42,0:47:22.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,又被寄宿学校踢出来了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you get kicked out of another boarding school?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.46,0:47:24.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妈的 洛莲 为你这个不争气的儿子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it, Lorraine. Do you know how much perfectly good dough{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.05,0:47:26.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我花了多少钱？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've blown on this no-good kid of yours, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.76,0:47:27.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,三个全不争气？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}On all three of them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.84,0:47:30.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你吵什么 又不是供不起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell do you care? We can afford it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.47,0:47:33.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少用那些钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The least we can do with all that money{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.26,0:47:35.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们的儿女过好点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}is provide a better life for our children.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.39,0:47:36.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on one second.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.77,0:47:39.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我先说清楚 马丁是你的儿子 不是我的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get this straight. Marty is your kid, not mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.94,0:47:41.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算用全世界的钱供他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And all the money in the world{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.15,0:47:42.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是没用{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}wouldn't do jack shit for that lazy bum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.06,0:47:45.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你别说了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it, Biff. Just stop it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.27,0:47:48.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看他 根本就是个笨蛋 和他老爸一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at him. He's a butthead, just like his old man was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.66,0:47:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不准你那样说乔治{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you dare speak that way about George.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.87,0:47:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你连他的一半都不如{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not even half the man he was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.08,0:48:03.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个猪狗不如的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You son of a bitch! Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.88,0:48:10.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远是那么暴躁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always the little hothead, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.18,0:48:18.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,想捅我几下吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna take a poke at me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.73,0:48:24.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 我受够了 我要离开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it, Biff. That's it. I'm leaving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.69,0:48:28.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就走呀 但想清楚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So go ahead. But think about this, Lorraine!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.48,0:48:30.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁替你付那些置装费{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's gonna pay for all your clothes, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.49,0:48:32.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有珠宝和酒？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And your jewelry and your liquor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.41,0:48:35.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁替你付美容整形费？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's gonna pay for your cosmetic surgery, Lorraine?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.66,0:48:39.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你要我弄得这么大的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were the one who wanted me to get these things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.66,0:48:42.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要就还给你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you want them back, you can have them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.50,0:48:44.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,听好了 你要是敢走出这扇门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Lorraine. You walk out that door, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.88,0:48:47.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不但不供你 也不供你那些孩子们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I won't only cut off you. I'll cut off your kids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.67,0:48:49.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wouldn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.80,0:48:50.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wouldn't I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.84,0:48:52.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先 我会取消{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}First your daughter, Linda.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.17,0:48:54.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你女儿琳达的信用卡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll cancel all her credit cards.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.14,0:48:56.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,让她自己去和银行交涉欠款{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She can settle her debts with the bank all by herself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.72,0:48:59.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那白痴儿子大卫 我要撤回他的假释{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your idiot son, Dave. I'll get his probation revoked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.93,0:49:02.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,至于马丁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And as for Marty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.10,0:49:04.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你喜欢看到 他们三个和你弟弟乔伊一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, maybe you'd like to have all three of your kids behind bars, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.02,0:49:07.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,全都关到牢里去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}just like your brother Joey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.19,0:49:09.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,在监狱里来个全家大团圆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One big, happy, jailbird family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.61,0:49:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 你赢 我留下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Biff. You win. I'll stay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.87,0:49:23.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,至于你 一小时内你最好消失{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As for you, I'll be back up here in an hour, so you better not be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.09,0:49:37.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没错 是我错了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was right, and I was wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.06,0:49:41.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.85,0:49:42.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom, what are you saying?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.02,0:49:44.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么能替他辩护？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're actually defending him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.81,0:49:47.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我自找的 他是我丈夫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had it coming. He's my husband, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.36,0:49:49.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且他照顾我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he takes care of all of us, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.90,0:49:51.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他应该得到我们的尊敬{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he deserves our respect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.69,0:49:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,尊敬？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Respect?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.65,0:49:57.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的丈夫！他怎么会是你的丈夫？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your husband! How could he be your husband?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.95,0:49:59.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么会离开爸爸嫁给他？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could you leave Dad for him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.08,0:50:01.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,离开爸爸？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave Dad?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.41,0:50:03.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,马丁 你没事吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marty, are you feeling all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.54,0:50:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我不好！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, I'm not feeling all right!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.08,0:50:08.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一点也不知道 这里发生了什么事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand one damn thing that's going on around here, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.71,0:50:11.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么没人告诉我呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and why nobody can give me a simple, straight answer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.84,0:50:14.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的头一定被打得很厉害{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, they must have hit you over the head hard this time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.80,0:50:17.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈 我只想知道一件事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom, I just want to know one thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.97,0:50:20.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的爸爸乔治在哪里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's my father? Where's George McFly?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.43,0:50:26.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔治…你的爸爸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marty, George, your father{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.10,0:50:29.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,十二年来一直在同一个地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}is in the same place he's been for the past 12 years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.61,0:50:33.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是橡园公墓内{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oak Park Cemetery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.04,0:50:52.63,Note,0,0,0,0,,（永恒的记忆 乔治麦佛莱之墓）
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.30,0:51:00.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.22,0:51:05.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能发生的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! This can't be happening!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.06,0:51:09.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,1973年3月15日？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"March 15, 1973."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.40,0:51:12.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 天啊 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Please, God, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.02,0:51:16.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔 上帝！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, please, God. Please, God, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.78,0:51:20.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不可能发生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This can't be happening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.82,0:51:23.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能的…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This can't be…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.41,0:51:25.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕这一切都是真的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid it is happening, Marty. All of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.33,0:51:27.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doc!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.54,0:51:28.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我知道你父亲的事时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I learned about your father, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.96,0:51:30.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,就猜你会到这里来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I figured you'd come here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.96,0:51:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你知道他出了什么事吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you know what happened to him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.13,0:51:42.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道1973年3月15日发生什么事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know what happened March 15, 1973?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.89,0:51:46.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Marty. I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.52,0:51:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我到图书馆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I went to the public library{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.68,0:51:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,想把事情弄清楚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to try to make sense out of all the madness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.69,0:51:52.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,图书馆被封闭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The place was boarded up, shut down, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.23,0:51:54.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,只好闯进去借报纸看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I broke in and borrowed some newspapers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.23,0:51:55.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我搞不懂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't get it, Doc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.90,0:51:57.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些事怎么会发生的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, how can all this be happening?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.94,0:51:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们像生活在地狱里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like we're in hell or something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.49,0:52:02.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 这里是山谷镇 不过地狱也不会差到哪里去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's Hill Valley. Although, I can't imagine hell being much worse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.58,0:52:07.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱因斯坦 对不起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Einie. I'm sorry, boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.04,0:52:11.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,实验室乱七八糟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The lab is an awful, awful, awful, awful mess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.67,0:52:14.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 乖狗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attaboy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.75,0:52:17.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,显然的 时空已经大乱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Obviously, the time continuum has been disrupted, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.05,0:52:20.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,由于两个时空的交替{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}creating this new temporal event sequence{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.55,0:52:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,而导致这种暂时的结果{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}resulting in this alternate reality.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.38,0:52:23.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,请你说白一点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}English, Doc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.51,0:52:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我画给你看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, here, here. Let me illustrate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.52,0:52:34.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,假设这条线代表时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Imagine that this line represents time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.73,0:52:39.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是现在1985年 这是未来 这是过去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's the present, 1985, the future and the past.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.28,0:52:44.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这一点之前 也就是过去的某个时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prior to this point in time, somewhere in the past, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.49,0:52:46.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间线被扭曲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the timeline skewed into this tangent{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.03,0:52:50.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,而创造出另一个1985年{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}creating an alternate 1985.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.12,0:52:53.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,对你、我和爱因斯坦 这是个扭曲的时空{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alternate to you, me and Einstein, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.42,0:52:57.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,但对别人则是真实的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but reality for everyone else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.76,0:53:03.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,认得这个吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Recognize this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.84,0:53:05.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是装运动年鉴的袋子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the bag the sports book came in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.97,0:53:08.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为收据还在里面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, because the receipt was still inside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.93,0:53:12.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在时光机里找到的 另外还有这个东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found them in the time machine along with this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.44,0:53:20.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是贝夫的拐杖头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the top of Biff's cane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.61,0:53:22.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是指未来的老贝夫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, Old Biff from the future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.28,0:53:24.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 如果它在时光机中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Correct. It was in the time machine{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.32,0:53:28.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就表示贝夫 和年鉴也曾待在时光机里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}because Biff was in the time machine with the sports almanac.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.29,0:53:30.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.45,0:53:33.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我们在未来时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, while we were in the future, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.37,0:53:34.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝夫拿走年鉴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Biff got the sports book, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.92,0:53:37.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,偷了时光机 回到过去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}stole the time machine, went back in time, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.33,0:53:40.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后把书给了自己{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and gave the book to himself at some point in the past.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.01,0:53:45.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看 证明就在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look. It says right here{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.26,0:53:47.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝夫在1958年{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that Biff made his first million{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.51,0:53:50.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,赢得一百万元{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}betting on a horse race in 1958.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.10,0:53:52.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,他并不是运气好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wasn't just lucky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.47,0:53:55.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,是因为他有年鉴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He knew because he had all the race results in the sports almanac.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.23,0:53:58.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是这样赚得全部的财富{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's how he made his entire fortune.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.65,0:54:01.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,用放大镜看他的口袋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at his pocket with a magnifying glass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.45,0:54:05.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是那本年鉴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The almanac.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.82,0:54:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,混蛋 居然偷我的主意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a bitch stole my idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.03,0:54:12.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一定听我讲…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He must have been listening when I…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.29,0:54:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我错了 整件事都是我的错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my fault. The whole thing is my fault.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.58,0:54:19.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,假如当初不买那本书{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I hadn't bought that damn book, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.67,0:54:21.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事也不会发生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}none of this would have ever happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.30,0:54:22.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,事情已经过去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's all in the past.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.50,0:54:23.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 是未来？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean the future?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.67,0:54:26.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管怎样 它证明{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever. It demonstrates precisely{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.63,0:54:28.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,时光机误用的可怕后果{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}how time travel can be misused{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.51,0:54:31.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,等把这些事情改正后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and why the time machine must be destroyed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.72,0:54:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定要把时光机毁掉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}after we straighten all of this out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.18,0:54:36.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我们回到未来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. So we go back to the future, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.35,0:54:38.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,阻止贝夫偷时光机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we stop Biff from stealing the time machine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.56,0:54:41.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 如果从这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't, because if we travel{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.19,0:54:43.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,出发去未来的话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}into the future from this point in time, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.73,0:54:47.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,那会进入这个时空的未来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}it will be the future of this reality, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.07,0:54:51.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这里 贝夫是个贪污且有势力的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in which Biff is corrupt and powerful{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.33,0:54:53.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,并和你妈妈结婚 而且…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and married to your mother{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.33,0:54:58.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也发生在我身上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and in which this has happened to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.76,0:55:03.59,Note,0,0,0,0,,（疯子发明家被判神精错乱）
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.71,0:55:08.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,若要改变现在必须回到过去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Our only chance to repair the present is in the past{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.68,0:55:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,回到时间线被扭曲之前{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}at the point where the timeline skewed into this tangent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.89,0:55:16.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了要恢复宇宙秩序{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In order to put the universe back as we remember it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.06,0:55:19.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,回到真正的时空{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and get back to our reality, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.48,0:55:21.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须找到真正的日期{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we have to find out the exact date{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.40,0:55:23.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有特定的环境{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the specific circumstances{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.27,0:55:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,在何时、何地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}of how, where and when Young Biff{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.19,0:55:28.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,小贝夫如何拿到那本运动年鉴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}got his hands on that sports almanac.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.41,0:55:32.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去问他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll ask him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.22,0:56:00.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,防弹衣！天呀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bulletproof vest! Great flick! Great frigging flick!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.69,0:56:02.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙真聪明！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The guy is brilliant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.27,0:56:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, what the hell's going…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.02,0:56:07.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到这里干什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! What the hell are you doing in here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.61,0:56:08.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝夫 宴会结束了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Party's over, Biff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.65,0:56:11.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,小姐们 对不起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, ladies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.03,0:56:14.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么会通过我的警卫？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you get past my security downstairs?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.45,0:56:17.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些事我想和你谈谈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a little matter we need to talk about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.24,0:56:19.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,想要钱吗？门都没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Money, right? Well, forget it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.66,0:56:21.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是要钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Not money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.46,0:56:26.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,「运动年鉴」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gray's Sports Almanac.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.34,0:56:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,听见他说的话了 小姐们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You heard him, girls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.80,0:56:34.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Party's over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.47,0:56:38.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,讲吧 你还知道些什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Start talking, kid. What else you know about that book?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.68,0:56:43.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先告诉我你怎么拿到的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}First, you tell me how you got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.98,0:56:47.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,在何时、何地、如何拿到的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How, where and when.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.65,0:56:51.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 你坐下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Take a seat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.99,0:56:57.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐下来！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.50,0:57:04.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间是1955年11月12日{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}November 12, 1955. That was when.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.37,0:57:07.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,1955年11月12日 那是我回来…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}November 12, 1955. That was the date I went back…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.84,0:57:12.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,那天正好是山谷镇 发生闪电暴风雨的日子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was the date of the famous Hill Valley lightning storm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.05,0:57:16.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对历史知道得不少 很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know your history. Very good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.68,0:57:19.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我永远忘不了那个星期六{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll never forget that Saturday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.52,0:57:21.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从车行里把车开回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd just picked my car up from the shop, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.31,0:57:24.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我去参加赛车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause I'd rolled it in a drag race a few days earlier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.56,0:57:27.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好像是撞进粪肥车里去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you crashed into a manure truck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.57,0:57:31.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know about that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.24,0:57:33.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸爸告诉我的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father told me about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.11,0:57:34.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爸爸？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your father?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.61,0:57:37.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,在他死前{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before he died.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.58,0:57:40.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔 对！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.29,0:57:44.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正在做我自己的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So there I was, minding my own business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.25,0:57:47.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个拄着拐杖的疯老头跑过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This crazy old codger with a cane shows up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.63,0:57:49.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说是我的远亲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He says he's my distant relative.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.71,0:57:51.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实我们一点也不像{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't see any resemblance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.38,0:57:56.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他问我 你想发财吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So he says, "How would you like to be rich?"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.80,0:57:58.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说 当然{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I said, "Sure."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.43,0:58:05.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就把这本书给我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So he lays this book on me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.56,0:58:07.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说这本书上有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He says this book will tell me the outcome{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.40,0:58:10.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,本世纪所有运动比赛的结果{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}of every sporting event till the end of the century.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.15,0:58:13.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只要赌赢的那一方 就永远不会输{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I have to do is bet on the winner, and I'll never lose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.82,0:58:18.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我问 你的目的是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I said, "What's the catch?"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.45,0:58:21.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说 我没有目的 但你一定要保密{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He says, "No catch. Just keep it a secret."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.62,0:58:28.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后他就不见了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}After that, he disappeared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.25,0:58:29.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直没再看见他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never saw him again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.31,0:58:44.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他另外还告诉我一件事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and he told me one more thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.60,0:58:47.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说 有一天一个疯狂科学家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said, "Someday a crazy, wild-eyed scientist, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.44,0:58:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是一个小孩可能会出现 问起这本书{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"or a kid may show up asking about that book.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.98,0:58:53.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,「如果真的发生了…」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"And if that ever happens…"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.28,0:59:01.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,有趣 没想到会是你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Funny. I never thought it would be you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.53,0:59:04.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝夫 你忘了一件事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, Biff, you're forgetting one thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.33,0:59:06.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么东西？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.96,0:59:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你死定了 混蛋！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're dead, you little son of a bitch!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.23,0:59:28.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在那里！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, there he is!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.31,0:59:29.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.48,0:59:56.97,Note,0,0,0,0,,（屋顶）
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.73,1:00:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,有种就跳呀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead, kid. Jump.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.15,1:00:17.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,自杀最好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A suicide will be nice and neat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.03,1:00:19.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我不自杀呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if I don't?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.61,1:00:22.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就请你吃子弹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lead poisoning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.45,1:00:24.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不怕警察吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the police, Biff?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.41,1:00:26.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会根据子弹找出手枪来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're gonna match up the bullet with that gun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.95,1:00:29.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,警察归我管{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kid, I own the police.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.04,1:00:33.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,况且他们至今仍找不到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides, they couldn't match up{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.29,1:00:35.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀你父亲的凶手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the bullet that killed your old man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.84,1:00:37.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个狗养…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You son of a…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.67,1:00:42.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想这就是因果报应{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suppose it's poetic justice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.93,1:00:47.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,两个麦佛莱被同一支枪杀死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two McFlys with the same gun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.40,1:00:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,白痴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Idiot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.41,1:01:05.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么搞的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.62,1:01:12.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士 门开得好！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice shot, Doc!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.67,1:01:15.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定不相信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not gonna believe this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.42,1:01:17.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们得回到1955年{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta go back to 1955.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.34,1:01:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't believe it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.60,1:01:32.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不错 是1955年11月12日{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right, Doc. November 12, 1955.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.93,1:01:36.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个老贝夫怎么会选那一天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unbelievable that Old Biff could've chosen that particular date.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.61,1:01:37.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许表示那一天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It could mean that that point in time{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.73,1:01:40.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,具有宇宙的重要性{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}inherently contains some sort of cosmic significance, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.44,1:01:42.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,是时空暂时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}almost as if it were the temporal junction point{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.44,1:01:44.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,汇聚点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the entire space-time continuum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.70,1:01:47.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者那只是个巧合{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the other hand, it could just be an amazing coincidence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.83,1:01:50.32,Note,0,0,0,0,,（1885年1月1日 目的地时间）
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.37,1:01:53.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 我得记得修这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn! Got to fix that thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.12,1:01:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 时间设定完成{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Time circuits on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.54,1:01:57.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是什么意思？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean, time circuits on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.71,1:01:59.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在就回去吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doc, we're not going back now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.42,1:02:00.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.55,1:02:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹妮弗和爱因斯坦怎么办？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doc, what about Jennifer? What about Einstein?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.38,1:02:03.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能把他们留在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't just leave them here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.84,1:02:05.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,放心 假设我们成功了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry, Marty. Assuming we succeed in our mission, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.05,1:02:09.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个被改变的1985年 就会变回原来的1985年{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}this alternate 1985 will be changed back into the real 1985, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.64,1:02:12.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹妮弗和爱因斯坦 也就跟着转变{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}instantaneously transforming around Jennifer and Einie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.97,1:02:14.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不会有事的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jennifer and Einie will be fine, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.60,1:02:17.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且会忘掉这里的一切{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they will have absolutely no memory of this horrible place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.48,1:02:18.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.48,1:02:21.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果不能成功呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if we don't succeed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.07,1:02:23.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定要成功{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must succeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.48,1:02:35.17,Note,0,0,0,0,,（里昂地产 您明日的家）
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.92,1:02:41.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,真奇怪 我怎么觉得好像昨天才来过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is heavy, Doc. I mean, it's like I was just here yesterday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.50,1:02:43.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是昨天才来过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were here yesterday, Marty. You were.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.34,1:02:44.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,想不到吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amazing, isn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.67,1:02:47.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,再过二十二分钟天就亮了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, sunrise should be in about 22 minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.93,1:02:51.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你先进城 我来找小贝夫的行踪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You go into town. Track down Young Biff and tail him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.30,1:02:53.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天的某段时间 老贝夫会出现{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometime today, Old Biff will show up{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.02,1:02:55.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,把书给小贝夫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to give Young Biff the almanac.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.52,1:02:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能干预{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Above all you, must not interfere with that event.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.69,1:03:00.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,让老贝夫以为他成功 这样他才会离开1955年{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must let Old Biff believe he's succeeded, so that he'll leave 1955{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.73,1:03:01.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,并把迪罗里安开到未来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and bring the DeLorean back to the future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.07,1:03:03.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.19,1:03:06.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,等老贝夫一走 只要有机会就把年鉴拿走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once Old Biff is gone, grab the almanac any way that you can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.40,1:03:08.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住 我们的未来就靠这次行动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember, both of our futures depend on this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.66,1:03:10.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不用提醒我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to remind me of that, Doc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.70,1:03:15.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是望远镜和无线电话机 保持联系{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's some binoculars and a walkie-talkie so we can keep in contact.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.37,1:03:18.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这里修机器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll stay here and try to repair the short in the time circuit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.50,1:03:21.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样就不怕有人偷车了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That way, we don't risk anyone else stealing the time machine, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.38,1:03:25.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不会冒 碰到另一个自己的危险{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I won't risk accidentally running into my other self.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.76,1:03:26.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,另一个自己？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Other self?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.84,1:03:29.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 这里有两个我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. There are now two of me here, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.09,1:03:30.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,和两个你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and there are two of you here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.05,1:03:35.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个是1955年的布朗博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The other me is the Dr. Emmett Brown from 1955, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.22,1:03:40.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他帮另一个你回到1985年{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the younger me that helps the other you get back to 1985.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.94,1:03:42.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,还记得电击钟塔吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember the lightning bolt at the clock tower?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.65,1:03:44.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是今晚才发生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. That event doesn't happen until tonight, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.73,1:03:47.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以千万小心不要碰到 另一个自己{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}so you must be very careful not to run into your other self.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.40,1:03:48.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你身上得带点钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me give you some money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.68,1:03:50.74,Note,0,0,0,0,,（紧急现金）
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.41,1:03:55.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须准备好各种不同的钞票{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to be prepared for all monetary possibilities.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.74,1:03:56.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,去买件50年代的衣服{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get yourself some '50s clothes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.08,1:03:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check, Doc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.92,1:04:01.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,别太引人注目{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something inconspicuous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.00,1:04:05.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士 这是马丁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doc. Come in, Doc. This is Marty. Over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.75,1:04:07.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道了 你到了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roger, Marty. This is Doc. Are you there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.05,1:04:11.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我已到达这个地址{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, Doc. I'm at the address.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.64,1:04:12.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一个添南家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the only Tannen in the book, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.93,1:04:14.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,似乎不是贝夫的家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I don't think this is Biff's house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.01,1:04:16.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个老太太住在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It looks like some old lady lives here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.97,1:04:18.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝夫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Biff! Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.14,1:04:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要去哪里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you going, Biff?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.19,1:04:23.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,奶奶 我去拿车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to get my car, Grandma.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.36,1:04:24.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么时候回来？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When are you coming back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.56,1:04:27.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你按摩我的脚指头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My feet hurt, and I want you to rub my toes some more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.11,1:04:29.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴 你这个老太婆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up, you old bag.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.19,1:04:31.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,把球还给我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give us our ball back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.61,1:04:33.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么球？- 那个球！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What ball? - That ball!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.49,1:04:35.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在说什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What ball are you talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.62,1:04:37.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,把球还给我们！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give us our ball!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.37,1:04:39.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,球？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What ball? Biff!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.33,1:04:41.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是你们的球吗 - 是的！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is this your ball? - Yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.12,1:04:42.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你们的球吗？你们想要回去？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it your ball? You want it back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.67,1:04:44.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.79,1:04:47.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,去拿呀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go get it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.84,1:04:55.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士 那是贝夫的家 我正在跟踪他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doc, it is Biff's house. I'm on him. Over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.31,1:05:04.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.11,1:05:08.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来不错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looking good, Terry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.32,1:05:09.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,全修好了 像崭新的一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Biff, she's all fixed up just like new, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.03,1:05:11.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没办法发动它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I couldn't get her started.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.70,1:05:13.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你装了特别的装置吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got some kind of kill switch on this thing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.61,1:05:15.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得知道按哪里才行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you just gotta have the right touch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.32,1:05:17.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了我没人能发动这部车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody can start this car but me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.20,1:05:19.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,一共三百零二元五毛七{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, the bill comes to $302.57.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.20,1:05:20.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,三百块钱？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}300 bucks?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.45,1:05:22.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,才几处小刮痕就要修三百元？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}300 bucks for a couple of dents?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.25,1:05:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你开什么玩笑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, hey, that's bullshit, Terry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.58,1:05:24.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有开玩笑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Biff, it was horse shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.87,1:05:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,车里全是马粪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The whole car was full of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.08,1:05:28.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还付约翰八十块把它弄走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had to pay Old Man Jones 80 bucks to haul it away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.21,1:05:29.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰可能把它卖了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Old Man Jones probably resold it, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.63,1:05:30.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该给我卖粪的钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I ought to get something for that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.84,1:05:31.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要钱？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want something for it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.05,1:05:33.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,打电话叫约翰给你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll go inside. You can call Old Man Jones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.93,1:05:34.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他肯给你的话…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he wants to give you a refund…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.05,1:05:36.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,三百块！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's 300 bucks, Terry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.68,1:05:40.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我找到那小鬼 一定把他脖子扭断{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I catch the guy that caused this, I'll break his neck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.68,1:05:43.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,粪肥 我记得了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The manure. I remember that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.11,1:05:52.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,四罐润滑油{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four cans of Valvoline is fair, Biff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.19,1:05:53.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,三百块只送四罐？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four cans for a $300 job?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.86,1:05:55.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我的午餐钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't even have lunch in the shop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.36,1:05:56.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该给我一箱润滑油{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Makes me nauseous. I should get a case of oil{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.70,1:05:58.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才肯给你300块{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}out of you for a 300 buck job. You've been inside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.62,1:06:00.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的大便车比厕所还难闻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It smells worse than the bathroom at a gas station.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.37,1:06:01.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又抢劫了我 对！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You robbed me again, Terry. Yeah, yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.75,1:06:03.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种味道永远不会消失{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The smell's never gonna go away, Biff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.58,1:06:04.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远不会消失{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never gonna go away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.71,1:06:06.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是最后一次帮你 谢啦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last time I do you a favor. Last time. Thanks a lot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.71,1:06:09.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我看看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.88,1:06:15.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛莲 太美了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's perfect, Lorraine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.72,1:06:16.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, look at it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.93,1:06:18.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定会很漂亮！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going to look so good!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.43,1:06:24.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看起来会像…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going to look…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.56,1:06:26.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在讲什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, lookey what we have here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.23,1:06:27.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,衣服真漂亮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, nice dress, Lorraine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.40,1:06:29.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我觉得 你什么都不穿会更好看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Although, I think you'd look better wearing nothing at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.90,1:06:32.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么不去跳海？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Biff, why don't you take a long walk off a short pier?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.86,1:06:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 洛莲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, listen, Lorraine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.99,1:06:35.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚学校有舞会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's that dance at school tonight, right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.40,1:06:36.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的车修好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now that my car's all fixed, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.66,1:06:37.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你有机会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I figure I'd cut you a break{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.95,1:06:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,很荣幸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and give you the honor of going{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.28,1:06:40.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,和最英俊的我一起去参加{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}with the best-looking guy in school.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.78,1:06:41.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很忙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, I'm busy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.91,1:06:43.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 忙什么？- 忙着洗头发{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, doing what? - Washing my hair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.58,1:06:46.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,那和战舰装纱门一样好笑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's about as funny as a screen door on a battleship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.33,1:06:48.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,笨蛋 是潜艇装纱门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Screen door on a submarine, you dork.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.46,1:06:51.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经有人邀请我了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Biff, somebody already asked me to the dance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.67,1:06:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁？那个猪头乔治吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who? That bug George McFly?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.46,1:06:57.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要和卡尔文克莱一起去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going with Calvin Klein, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.22,1:06:58.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔文克莱？不行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calvin Klein? No, it's not okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.55,1:07:01.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要和我一起去 懂吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going with me, understand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.26,1:07:02.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你的爪子拿开！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get your cooties off me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.64,1:07:04.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么时候你才能想清楚？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When are you gonna get it through your thick skull, Lorraine?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.89,1:07:06.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是我的女孩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're my girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.27,1:07:08.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算你有一百万{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Biff Tannen, I wouldn't be your girl{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.14,1:07:10.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不要你！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}even if you had a million dollars!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.44,1:07:16.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会的！你我一定会在一起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, you will! It's you and me, Lorraine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.03,1:07:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心点！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.32,1:07:21.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是命中注定的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's meant to be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.20,1:07:23.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,总有一天我会娶你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to marry you someday, Lorraine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.45,1:07:25.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会变成我太太！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someday you'll be my wife!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.62,1:07:31.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对女人永远有一套{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You always did have a way with women.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.21,1:07:33.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,老家伙 滚出我的车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the hell out of my car, old man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.29,1:07:34.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想娶她吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to marry that girl, Biff?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.84,1:07:36.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能帮你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can help make it happen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.30,1:07:38.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁 寂寞芳心俱乐部吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah? Who are you, Miss Lonely-Hearts?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.47,1:07:41.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,笨蛋 上车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just get in the car, butthead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.34,1:07:43.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫谁笨蛋 笨蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you calling butthead, butthead?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.47,1:07:45.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么弄的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know how to do that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.68,1:07:48.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了我没人会发动我的车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody can start this car but me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.23,1:07:51.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,快上车 今天算你走运{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just get in the car, Tannen. Today's your lucky day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.36,1:07:57.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,老家伙 你小心开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Hey! Hey, watch where you're driving, old man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.53,1:08:00.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,刮到它 我就杀了你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you dent this car, I'll kill you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.38,1:08:03.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呀！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}God{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.83,1:08:08.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才花了三百块{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This cost me 300 bucks!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.71,1:08:10.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你别再念了 行不行？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you shut up about the car?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.21,1:08:13.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道我住哪里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, and another thing. How do you know where I live?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.21,1:08:15.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,算我们有亲戚关系吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just say we're related, Biff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.50,1:08:18.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,正因为如此 我有个礼物给你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that being the case, I got a little present for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.13,1:08:20.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,会让你发大财{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something that'll make you rich.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.34,1:08:21.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想发财 对不对？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to be rich, don't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.43,1:08:24.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,那当然 老迷糊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah. Sure. Right. That's rich.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.43,1:08:26.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道你能让我发财吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going to make me rich?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.89,1:08:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到这本书吗 这本书会告诉你未来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see this book? This book tells the future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.19,1:08:32.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,它告诉你 本世纪所有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tells the results of every major sports event{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.27,1:08:33.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,运动比赛的结果{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}till the end of the century.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.56,1:08:37.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管是足球、棒球 赛马、拳击赛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Football, baseball, horse races, boxing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.65,1:08:42.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面的资料值千百万 我现在把它给你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The information in here is worth millions, and I'm giving it to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.53,1:08:45.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's very nice. Thank you very much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.20,1:08:49.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说完了吧 那就请你离去之{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, why don't you make like a tree and get out of here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.04,1:08:53.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,笨蛋 不是离去之 是离去兮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's leave, you idiot. Make like a tree and leave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.88,1:08:56.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你咬文嚼字像个大白痴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sound like a damn fool when you say it wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.17,1:09:00.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 你走！把书也带走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, then, leave and take your book with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.13,1:09:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么还是没想通？用这本书你可以发大财{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you get it? You could make a fortune with this book.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.89,1:09:05.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我证明给你看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me show you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.64,1:09:12.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,加州大学落后 比数是17比16{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}UCLA trails 17-16.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.44,1:09:15.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这场比赛只剩下18秒钟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's 4th and 11 with only 18 seconds left of this game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.86,1:09:18.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来加州大学输定了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd say it's all over for UCLA.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.07,1:09:22.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和你赌加州大学 以19比17获胜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bet you a million bucks UCLA wins it 19-17.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.90,1:09:24.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是不是聋了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you, deaf, old man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.16,1:09:26.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,比赛已经结束 你输了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He just said it was over. You lost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.57,1:09:28.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.49,1:09:29.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在踢球{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here comes Decker with the kick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.91,1:09:31.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来很不错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's up. It looks good, folks!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.50,1:09:35.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来很不错 踢进球门！加州大学队 以19比17获胜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It looks very good. Field goal! UCLA wins 19-17.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.08,1:09:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的观众都疯狂了…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to that Coliseum crowd go wild. Jim Decker…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.09,1:09:41.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 到底是怎么回事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, pops. What's the gag?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.42,1:09:43.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么会知道比数？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you know what the score was gonna be?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.42,1:09:45.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉你 全在这本书里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you. It's in this book.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.72,1:09:49.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只要赌赢的那一方 就永远不会输{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All you gotta do is bet on the winner, and you'll never lose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.85,1:09:57.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我会看一看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. I'll take a look at it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.86,1:10:01.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个笨蛋！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You damn fool!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.03,1:10:04.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远…永远不能把书随便放{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never, never leave this book laying around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.03,1:10:07.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你难道没有保险箱？对 你没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you have a safe? No, you don't have a safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.12,1:10:11.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,去买个保险箱 把它锁在里面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get a safe. Keep it locked up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.04,1:10:13.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那之前 永远放在你身上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And until then, keep it on you like this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.00,1:10:15.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干嘛？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, what are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.12,1:10:16.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能对任何人提起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And don't tell anybody about it, either.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.04,1:10:18.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一件事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there's one more thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.38,1:10:22.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一天一个孩子 或是一个疯老头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One day, a kid or a crazy, wild-eyed old man{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.30,1:10:23.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,说他自己是科学家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}who claims to be a scientist{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.92,1:10:26.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,会来这里问…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}is going to come around asking about this…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.01,1:10:31.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果发生了这件事…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If that ever happens…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.99,1:10:53.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我出不去了 博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trapped. Doc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.49,1:10:54.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士 请回答{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doc, come in, Doc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.75,1:10:56.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 情况如何？- 贝夫走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Marty, what's the report? - Biff's gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.12,1:10:58.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他拿到书{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's got the book.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.33,1:11:00.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,老人也走了 我被锁在贝夫的车房里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The old man's gone, too. I'm locked in Biff's garage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.46,1:11:01.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你开迪罗里安{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta fly the DeLorean over here{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.71,1:11:02.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,来这里救我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and get me the hell out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.17,1:11:04.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,地址是梅森街1809号{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The address is 1809 Mason Street.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.01,1:11:06.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,白天不能开这部车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't take the DeLorean out in the daylight, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.01,1:11:08.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 我会想办法过去的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but don't worry, Marty. Somehow I'll get over there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.01,1:11:12.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士 等一下…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doc, wait a minute. Doc. Hey, Doc. Doc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.93,1:11:15.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,真倒霉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perfect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.40,1:11:22.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝夫 你到哪里去？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Biff, where are you going now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.27,1:11:25.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,奶奶 不是告诉你我要去参加舞会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you, Grandma. I'm going to the dance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.19,1:11:27.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 几点回家？- 舞会？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- When you coming home? - The dance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.24,1:11:29.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想回来时就会回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get home when I get home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.28,1:11:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,别忘了关车库的灯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't forget to turn off the garage light.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.15,1:12:07.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,马丁 马丁！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marty. Marty!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.24,1:12:09.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,马丁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.66,1:12:14.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,马丁 马丁 糟糕！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marty, Marty. Damn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.91,1:12:16.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,马丁到哪儿去了呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is that kid?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.10,1:12:18.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 爸爸爱曼波 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Father loves Mambo ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.02,1:12:21.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 妈妈爱曼波… ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Mother loves Mambo… ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.33,1:12:25.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士 请回答{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doc. Doc, come in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.09,1:12:27.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士 请回答{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come in, Doc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.38,1:12:29.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,马丁 请说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marty! Marty, come in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.76,1:12:30.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.80,1:12:36.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,马丁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.14,1:12:38.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟糕…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.44,1:12:42.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great Scott.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.04,1:12:59.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.63,1:13:05.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士 请回答{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doc, Doc, come in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.84,1:13:07.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,马丁 怎么回事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marty, what happened to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.55,1:13:09.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么没在贝夫家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I went to Biff's house, and you weren't there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.17,1:13:10.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们错过了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must have just missed me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.30,1:13:11.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在贝夫车里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in the back of Biff's car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.42,1:13:13.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,正在往舞会的方向前进{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's on his way to the Enchantment Under the Sea dance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.39,1:13:16.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能要取消这个计划{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marty, listen, we may have to abort this entire plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.47,1:13:17.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,太危险了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's getting much too dangerous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.97,1:13:19.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,书就在车子的仪表板上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry. The book is on Biff's dashboard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.64,1:13:20.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会拿到的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll grab it as soon as we get to the school.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.06,1:13:23.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,马丁 你千万要小心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marty, you must be extremely careful{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.23,1:13:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,别撞上另一个自己{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}not to run into your other self.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.69,1:13:26.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 另一个自己？- 对！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My other self? - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.02,1:13:31.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你妈妈和你 也去参加同一个舞会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember, your mother is at that exact same dance with you. Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.24,1:13:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 太严重了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. This could get heavy, Doc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.49,1:13:34.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,严重 严重{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heavy, heavy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.74,1:13:37.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管发生什么事 都不能让另一个自己看到你！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marty, whatever happens, you must not let your other self see you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.45,1:13:39.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则后果不堪设想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The consequences could be disastrous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.74,1:13:41.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 帮个忙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.21,1:13:43.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是戴帽子的那位{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, you with the hat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.83,1:13:44.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁 我吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who, me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.00,1:13:46.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.42,1:13:50.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托把工具箱里 八分之五的板手递给我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be a pal and hand me a five-eighths inch wrench out of that toolbox.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.26,1:13:52.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,八分之五的板手？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five-eighths?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.51,1:13:56.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该是四分之三吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you mean three-quarters?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.68,1:13:59.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说对了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why, you're right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.56,1:14:05.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你像是在做某种天气测试{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I presume you're conducting some sort of weather experiment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.19,1:14:10.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 你怎么知道的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right. How did you know that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.36,1:14:14.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这方面有点经验{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I happen to have had a little experience in this area.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.40,1:14:17.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望今晚能有闪电出现{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, well, I'm hoping to see some lightning tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.16,1:14:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽管气象员说不会有雨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Although, the weatherman says there's not gonna be any rain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.28,1:14:21.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,放心 会有很多的雨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's going to be plenty of rain, all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.66,1:14:23.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,风 打雷、闪电{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wind, thunder, lightning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.96,1:14:25.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,将是个很大的暴风雨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna be one hell of a storm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.75,1:14:28.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 很高兴和你聊天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, thanks. Nice talking to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.63,1:14:32.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,说不定将来会再见面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we'll bump into each other some time again in the future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.46,1:14:35.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许是过去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or in the past.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.17,1:15:17.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士 请回答{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doc, Doc! Come in!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.57,1:15:39.46,Note,0,0,0,0,,（海洋魅力舞会）
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.84,1:15:56.73,Note,0,0,0,0,,（美女图鉴）
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.17,1:16:33.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔伊 那个猪头卡尔文克莱在哪儿？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's that punk Calvin Klein, anyway?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.04,1:16:35.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么会知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How am I supposed to know, Biff?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.17,1:16:36.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我又不是他的秘书{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ain't his secretary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.34,1:16:39.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,去找他 他害我花了三百块{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, go find him. He caused 300 bucks damage to my car, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.34,1:16:41.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定要赏他一顿饱拳！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I owe him a knuckle sandwich. Get going!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.97,1:16:43.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快去！这给你 - 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Drink up, Biff. - Yeah, thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.34,1:16:44.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不来吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ain't you coming?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.43,1:16:45.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要看书{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm reading.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.23,1:17:40.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 贝夫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, well, well, Mr. Tannen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.57,1:17:43.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴看到你在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How nice to see you here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.40,1:17:46.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,史特兰老师 很高兴见到你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why, Mr. Strickland, it's nice to see you, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.57,1:17:47.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好像闻到酒味{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that liquor I smell, Tannen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.49,1:17:49.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.08,1:17:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知酒为何物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what liquor smells like, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.41,1:17:52.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我太年轻不能喝酒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause I'm too young to drink it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.71,1:17:54.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.50,1:17:56.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在看什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what have we here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.92,1:18:03.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,运动年鉴 有趣的主题 是家庭作业吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sports statistics, interesting subject. Homework, Tannen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.51,1:18:06.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 我又不在家里 怎么会是家庭作业{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it ain't homework, 'cause I ain't at home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.43,1:18:09.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的态度非常有问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got a real attitude problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.64,1:18:11.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗？走着瞧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know that, Tannen? Just watch it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.31,1:18:12.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,总有一天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because one day, I'll have you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.43,1:18:14.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要好好处罚你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}right where I want you in detention.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.98,1:18:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,懒鬼！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slacker!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.95,1:18:30.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 你还抽烟？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus, you smoke, too?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.99,1:18:33.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你讲话跟我妈一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marty, you're beginning to sound just like my mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.83,1:18:35.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.33,1:18:38.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我有小孩 我会让他们做他们想做的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I have kids, I'm going to let them do anything they want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.71,1:18:40.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.29,1:18:41.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,真该让她写契约书{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'd like to have that in writing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.96,1:18:43.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是这么觉得{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, me, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.30,1:18:46.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,马丁 你干嘛这么紧张？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marty, why are you so nervous?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:57.25,1:18:58.91,Note,0,0,0,0,,（训导处）
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.26,1:20:52.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿到了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.22,1:20:57.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.10,1:21:07.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么会是「美女图鉴」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Oh Lo Lo?"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:13.28,1:21:14.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doc! Doc!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.70,1:21:15.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,混蛋 把你的脏手拿开…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.95,1:21:17.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士 请回答！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doc, come in!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.62,1:21:18.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,马丁 怎么样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marty, what's up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.95,1:21:21.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我搞砸了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doc! I'm in trouble. I blew it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.54,1:21:22.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,书在哪里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the book?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.75,1:21:23.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,在贝夫那里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Biff must still have it with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.12,1:21:25.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只拿到封页{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I got is the damn cover.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:25.54,1:21:26.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝夫在哪里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And where's Biff?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.84,1:21:28.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你自找的 我不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're asking for it. I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.96,1:21:30.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you have any idea where he is?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.34,1:21:32.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他现在可能在任何地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! I mean, he could be anywhere by now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.76,1:21:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家的未来都决定在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marty, the entire future depends on you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.39,1:21:36.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能不能拿到那本书！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}finding Biff and getting that book back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.47,1:21:37.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 我只是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. I just don't know where…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.89,1:21:39.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝夫 住手！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.47,1:21:42.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手 他的手会断的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it, Biff. You'll break his arm. Stop it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.06,1:21:48.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.15,1:21:51.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得走了 还有一个机会！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta go. I got one chance!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.28,1:21:53.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我老爸将要揍贝夫了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My old man is about to deck Biff!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.74,1:22:01.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,好！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.26,1:22:16.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像进入幻境一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk about deja vu.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:17.09,1:22:18.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:38.53,1:22:40.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 大家让一让{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, everybody, let's back up now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.53,1:22:42.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后一点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's back up. Let's everybody just back up{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.75,1:22:44.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,给他一点空间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and give him a little bit of room, okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.20,1:22:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,给他一点空气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little bit of air.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.29,1:22:48.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题 我会心肺复苏术{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. I know CPR. I know CPR.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.29,1:22:49.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.50,1:22:50.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么是心肺复苏术？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's CPR?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.96,1:22:52.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.88,1:22:56.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.97,1:22:58.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是不是拿了他的皮夹？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, did you just take his wallet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.05,1:23:00.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他把那家伙的皮夹拿走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He just took that guy's wallet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.22,1:23:03.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士 我拿到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doc, success. I got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.72,1:23:05.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢天谢地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank goodness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.64,1:23:08.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,干的好 马丁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great, Marty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.40,1:23:10.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把熔解器装上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As soon as I reload the fusion generator, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.40,1:23:12.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在体育馆屋顶见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll meet you on the roof of the high school gym.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.86,1:23:14.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,屋顶见 知道了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the roof. 10-4.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.40,1:23:15.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 是他！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, it's him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.07,1:23:17.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想伪装逃跑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, he's in disguise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.45,1:23:19.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, what's that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.16,1:23:22.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,去抓他！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Let's get him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.13,1:23:31.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.30,1:23:32.99,Note,0,0,0,0,,（1885年1月1日 目的地时间）
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.72,1:23:42.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 凡间天使 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Earth angel ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:23:42.55,1:23:45.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 请属于我 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Please be mine ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.97,1:23:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我亲爱的 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ My darling dear ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.27,1:23:51.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 永远爱你 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Love you for all time ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.11,1:23:54.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我是傻瓜 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ I'm just a fool ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.69,1:23:59.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 爱上你的 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ A fool in love ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.12,1:24:04.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 傻瓜 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ with you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.46,1:24:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我们再唱一首{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right! Let's do another one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.79,1:24:15.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他到哪里去了？不是才进来嘛！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did he go? He just came in here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.55,1:24:17.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,该来一首特别的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something that really cooks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.88,1:24:20.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们看！他怎么会到台上去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look! How did he get up on stage?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:20.43,1:24:22.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,等他下台就去抓他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, but when he gets down, we're gonna nail him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.80,1:24:25.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,衣服怎么会换得这么快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How the hell did he change his clothes so fast?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:25.31,1:24:27.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我们那边是老歌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, it's an oldie where I come from.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:27.85,1:24:30.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一首即兴蓝调{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, guys, listen, this is a blues riff in B.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.10,1:24:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意我的节拍 尽量跟上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch me for the changes, and try and keep up, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:38.86,1:24:40.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士 请回答！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doc. Doc, come in!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.24,1:24:41.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,马丁 请说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marty, come in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.53,1:24:46.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝夫的同党追进体育馆 他们要抓我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, Biff's guys chased me into the gym, and they're going to jump me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.16,1:24:47.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就快离开那里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then get out of there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:47.66,1:24:49.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 是另一个我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Doc, not me. The other me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.66,1:24:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是那个在舞台上演奏的我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The one that's up on stage playing Johnny B. Goode.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.08,1:24:53.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天！那他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great Scott! Your other self will miss{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.71,1:24:54.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,会错失钟楼闪电{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the lightning bolt at the clock tower, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:54.96,1:24:56.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你会回不去 这是大灾难！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you won't get back to the future, and we'll have a major paradox!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:57.05,1:24:59.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 什么灾难？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait, wait. A paradox?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.09,1:25:01.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,是会毁灭宇宙的灾难吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean one of those things that can destroy the universe?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.51,1:25:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要设法阻止那些人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Precisely. Marty, you have to stop those guys at all costs, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.89,1:25:06.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,同时不能碰上另一个你 或是你的父母{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but without being seen by your other self or your parents.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.93,1:25:08.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}10-4.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.52,1:25:10.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么搞的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:14.52,1:25:16.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他到哪里去了？- 谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where is he? - Who?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.11,1:25:17.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 卡尔文克莱 - 谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Calvin Klein. - Who?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.73,1:25:18.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴帽子的家伙 他在哪？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The guy with the hat, where is he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.03,1:25:21.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他往那边去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. He went that way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:21.24,1:25:24.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好像看到他拿了你的皮夹 我好像看到他拿了你的皮夹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think he took your wallet. I think he took his wallet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.74,1:25:27.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,走 强尼 走 走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, Johnny, go, go, go{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.41,1:25:31.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,强尼毕谷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Johnny B. Goode{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.52,1:25:50.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,走 走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.27,1:25:53.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,走 强尼 走 走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, Johnny, go, go{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.06,1:25:56.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,走 强尼 走 走 走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, Johnny, go, go, go{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.94,1:25:59.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,走 强尼 走 走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, Johnny, go, go{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.86,1:26:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,走 强尼 走 走 走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, Johnny, go, go, go{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.40,1:26:04.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,强尼毕谷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Johnny B. Goode{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:21.36,1:27:24.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们大概还没办法 接受这样的音乐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess you guys aren't ready for that yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:25.15,1:27:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你们的小孩会喜欢的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But your kids are going to love it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.16,1:27:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士 成功了 没事了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Doc, success. Everything's cool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.58,1:27:41.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在一分钟内 会降落在屋顶上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. I'll be landing at the school roof in about one minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.84,1:27:43.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在那里等你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.01,1:27:52.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛莲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lorraine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.35,1:27:55.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,马丁 那首歌满特别的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marty, that was very interesting music.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.02,1:28:01.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望你不介意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope you don't mind, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.15,1:28:03.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔治说要送我回家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but George asked if he could take me home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:03.52,1:28:06.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我就知道你们会合得来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. Lorraine, I had a feeling about you two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.61,1:28:08.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也这么觉得{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a feeling, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.03,1:28:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 笨蛋！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, butthead!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:11.62,1:28:14.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为那种伪装能骗得了我？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think that stupid disguise would get by me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.37,1:28:19.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们来分个胜负 现在 你和我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's have it out. You and me, right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.42,1:28:21.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.71,1:28:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么啦？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the matter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.88,1:28:27.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要去哪里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.97,1:28:29.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来你是个胆小鬼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you chicken?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.93,1:28:34.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,说对了 你是个胆小鬼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it, isn't it? Nothing but a little chicken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.78,1:28:52.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人叫我胆小鬼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody calls me chicken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.75,1:29:02.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.29,1:29:06.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你居然偷我东西？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You steal my stuff?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:07.92,1:29:10.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一脚是为我车子踢的！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this one's for my car!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:35.66,1:29:36.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doc!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.99,1:29:39.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士 我搞砸了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doc! I blew it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.70,1:29:40.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝夫抓到我 并把书拿走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Biff nailed me. He took the book.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:41.04,1:29:43.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他开车走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He drove away with it in his car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:43.29,1:29:45.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我的错 我应该早点来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my fault, Doc. I should have got out of there sooner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.50,1:29:47.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管了 他往哪儿去？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No time for that now. Which way did he go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:47.46,1:29:48.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,向东 朝隧道开去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}East towards the River Road Tunnel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:48.63,1:29:49.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,快上车！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:00.97,1:30:02.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:02.64,1:30:04.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士 他就在那里！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There he is, Doc!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:04.52,1:30:06.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,降落在他车上 把车弄瘫掉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's land on him. We'll cripple his car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.56,1:30:08.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是迪罗里安 太轻了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marty, he's in a '46 Ford. We're a DeLorean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:08.57,1:30:11.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,反而会被他拆散{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'd rip through us like we were tin foil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:11.19,1:30:13.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那我们该怎么做？- 我有办法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So what do we do? - I have a plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.28,1:30:15.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,重复今晚的气象报告{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Repeating tonight's earlier weather bulletin, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:15.45,1:30:17.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,一场大雷雨 正朝山谷镇方向进行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}a severe thunderstorm is heading for Hill Valley.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:40.43,1:30:42.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,本电台服务所有山谷郡地区{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Serving Hill Valley and all of Hill County, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:42.60,1:30:45.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,您现在正收听KKHV电台 山谷之声{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're tuned to KKHV, the voice of Hill Valley.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:53.86,1:30:55.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,至于社区日程表{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turning to community calendar, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.61,1:30:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,山谷镇妇女俱乐部蛋糕拍卖会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Hill Valley Women's Club bake sale{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:57.49,1:30:58.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,将于明天下午两点到五点举行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}will be held tomorrow afternoon{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:58.87,1:31:02.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,地点是在 森林路的社区活动中心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}from 2:00 to 5:00 at the community center on Forest Road.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:02.70,1:31:03.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,至于运动迷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For you sports fans out there, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:04.04,1:31:06.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天的大学足球赛真是高潮起伏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}there was a lot of action today in college football.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:06.62,1:31:08.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是前十名的资料{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's what happened to the top 10.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:08.79,1:31:12.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,加州大学 以19比17胜华盛顿大学{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}UCLA narrowly defeated Washington 19-17.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.55,1:31:15.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,密歇根州大学 以42比14胜明尼苏达{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michigan State crushed Minnesota 42-14.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:15.97,1:31:18.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,俄亥俄州大学 以20比10胜爱荷华{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ohio State beat lowa 20-10.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:18.76,1:31:20.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,密歇根大胜印第安纳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michigan blanked Indiana 30-0.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:20.30,1:31:21.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟糕！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:21.47,1:31:23.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣母院赢北卡罗来纳 27比7{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was Notre Dame over North Carolina, 27-7.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:23.27,1:31:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妈的！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:24.68,1:31:27.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,俄克拉荷马 大胜爱荷华州大学{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oklahoma ripped lowa State 52-0.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:28.56,1:31:31.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,西弗吉尼亚 以26比7输给匹兹堡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}West Virginia lost to Pittsburgh 26-7.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:31.73,1:31:34.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,德州农工大学 以20比10赢莱斯队{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Texas A&M over Rice 20-10.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:34.78,1:31:37.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,马里兰 以25比12胜克雷蒙森{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maryland defeated Clemson 25-12, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:37.45,1:31:41.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,德州基督大学 以47比20胜德州大学{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it was Texas Christian over Texas 47-20.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:41.58,1:31:45.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,重复今晚的气象报告 一场大雷雨…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Repeating tonight's earlier weather bulletin, a severe…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:45.25,1:31:47.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,又是你？把那本书给我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You again? Give me that book.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:50.21,1:31:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,放手！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let it go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.93,1:32:00.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,离我的车远一点！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let go of the car!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:18.08,1:32:19.48,Note,0,0,0,0,,（前方有隧道）
Dialogue: 0,1:32:34.46,1:32:36.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他应该学到教训了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That'll teach him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:10.56,1:34:12.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士 快走！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, Doc!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:12.31,1:34:13.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,马丁 抓紧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on, Marty!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:18.86,1:34:20.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:27.07,1:34:28.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,活该！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:38.46,1:34:41.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,粪肥！我恨粪肥！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Manure! I hate manure!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:05.78,1:35:08.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士 一切都好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doc, is everything all right? Over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:08.49,1:35:11.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是飞行的好天气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}10-4, Marty, but it's pretty miserable flying weather.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:11.28,1:35:12.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,降落时会遇到很多乱流{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Much too turbulent to make a landing from this direction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:12.95,1:35:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须从南方进来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll have to circle around and make a long approach from the south.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:15.46,1:35:17.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你拿到书了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you got the book?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:18.04,1:35:20.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿到了 就在我手中！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In my hand, Doc! I got it in my hand!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:20.71,1:35:22.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,烧掉它！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burn it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:22.55,1:35:23.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,好！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:53.67,1:35:55.06,Note,0,0,0,0,,（贝夫的家）
Dialogue: 0,1:35:55.17,1:35:57.26,Note,0,0,0,0,,（极乐天堂）
Dialogue: 0,1:35:59.84,1:36:01.60,Note,0,0,0,0,,（汽车保养）
Dialogue: 0,1:36:07.74,1:36:10.76,Note,0,0,0,0,,（乔治麦佛莱被谋杀 本地作家被枪杀致死）
Dialogue: 0,1:36:10.87,1:36:13.03,Note,0,0,0,0,,（乔治麦佛莱的荣耀 本地作家得奖）
Dialogue: 0,1:36:19.35,1:36:22.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士 报纸变了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doc! Doc! That newspaper changed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:22.40,1:36:24.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸爸没死！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doc, my father's alive!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:24.11,1:36:26.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,那表示一切回复正常 对不对？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That means everything's back to normal, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:27.01,1:36:29.04,Note,0,0,0,0,,（艾米布朗被判决 疯子发明家被判神精错乱）
Dialogue: 0,1:36:29.07,1:36:30.69,Note,0,0,0,0,,（艾米布朗接受表扬 本地发明家获奖）
Dialogue: 0,1:36:30.70,1:36:32.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,任务完成{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mission accomplished.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:32.99,1:36:35.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,这表示詹妮弗和爱因斯坦也都没事 对不对？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That means Jennifer's okay and Einie's okay, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:35.66,1:36:38.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 影响已在逐渐扩大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right, Marty. It's the ripple effect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:38.87,1:36:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,未来已经正常了 我们回去吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The future is back, so let's go home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:41.00,1:36:43.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 赶快把我接走 好回到…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Let's get our asses back to the…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:50.09,1:36:51.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士 你没事吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doc, Doc, are you okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:52.22,1:36:55.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,真惊险 我几乎买了那个农场{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was a close one, Marty. I almost bought the farm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:58.77,1:37:02.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心点 别让闪电击到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, be careful. You don't want to get struck by lightning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:16.78,1:37:17.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:26.92,1:37:27.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doc?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:29.13,1:37:30.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士 请回答{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doc, come in, Doc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:32.51,1:37:34.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听得到吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doc, do you read me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:35.30,1:37:38.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听得到吗 请回答{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you read me, Doc? Come in. Doc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:51.65,1:37:52.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:01.45,1:38:02.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:04.96,1:38:06.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The doc's gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:29.48,1:38:30.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦佛莱先生！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. McFly!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:31.61,1:38:32.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:35.49,1:38:37.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的名字是马丁麦佛莱吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is your name Marty McFly?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:43.00,1:38:44.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:46.33,1:38:48.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有东西要交给你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got something for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:50.88,1:38:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,一封信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A letter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:53.59,1:38:55.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,一封给我的信？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A letter for me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:56.43,1:38:58.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么可能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's impossible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:59.68,1:39:00.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the hell are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:00.97,1:39:02.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,西部联合银行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Western Union.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:02.68,1:39:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们公司的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, a bunch of us at the office were kind of hoping{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:05.18,1:39:07.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你能点醒我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe you could shed some light on the subject.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:07.56,1:39:12.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们持有这封信已有七十年{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, we've had that envelope in our possession for the past 70 years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:15.03,1:39:17.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面有着非常清楚的指示{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was given to us with the explicit instructions{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:18.03,1:39:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,要我们交给像你这样的年青人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that it be delivered to a young man with your description{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:22.29,1:39:26.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的名字是马丁 就在1955年11月12日{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}answering to the name of Marty at this exact location{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:26.91,1:39:30.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个时间、这个地点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}at this exact minute, November 12, 1955.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:31.38,1:39:32.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们甚至下注赌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a little bet going as to whether{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:32.80,1:39:34.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,马丁会不会出现{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}this Marty would actually be here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:34.71,1:39:36.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来我输了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like I lost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:37.38,1:39:38.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说是七十年前？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you say 70 years?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:38.93,1:39:41.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,正确的时间是 七十年两个月又十二天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, 70 years, 2 months, 12 days to be exact.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:41.76,1:39:43.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,请在第六行签名{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here sign on line 6, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:43.72,1:39:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是笔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:53.82,1:39:55.34,Note,0,0,0,0,,（你的朋友布朗博士）
Dialogue: 0,1:39:55.44,1:39:57.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是博士寄来的！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's from the doc!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:01.62,1:40:04.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,「亲爱的马丁 如果我的计算无误{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Dear Marty, if my calculations are correct, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:04.58,1:40:06.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你看到迪罗里安 被闪电击中后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you will receive this letter immediately after{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:06.25,1:40:09.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会马上看到这封信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you saw the DeLorean struck by lightning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:09.25,1:40:12.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先你放心 我活得很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}First, let me assure you that I'm alive and well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:12.29,1:40:15.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去八个月中 我在1885年代活的很愉快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been living happily these past eight months in the year 1885.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:15.84,1:40:18.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,闪电使我进入… 1885年！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The lightning bolt…1885!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:19.43,1:40:20.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,1885年的9月「{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}September, 1885."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:21.76,1:40:25.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 等等 这到底是怎么回事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait, kid! Wait a minute. What's this all about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:25.26,1:40:28.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还活着 博士还活着！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's alive! The doc's alive!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:28.85,1:40:31.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在老西部 但仍活着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's in the Old West, but he's alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:31.10,1:40:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but, kid, you all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:33.11,1:40:34.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要帮忙吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you need any help?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:34.94,1:40:37.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一个人能帮我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's only one man who can help me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:52.56,1:41:54.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士！博士！博士！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doc! Doc! Doc!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:55.06,1:41:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 博士！博士！- 什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Doc! Doc! - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:58.69,1:42:00.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士 别怕 是我马丁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, relax, Doc. It's me. It's me! It's Marty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:01.07,1:42:03.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能！我才把你送回未来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it can't be. I just sent you back to the future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:03.70,1:42:04.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. No, I know. You did send me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:04.91,1:42:06.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我又回来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}back to the future, but I'm back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:06.95,1:42:09.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我又从未来回来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm back from the future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:12.21,1:42:13.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great Scott!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:15.96,1:42:19.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士 博士 博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doc! Doc. Doc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:21.21,1:42:22.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么啦？博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fantastic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:26.68,1:42:30.82,Note,0,0,0,0,,（未完待续）
Dialogue: 0,1:42:33.10,1:42:35.49,Note,0,0,0,0,,（山谷镇）
Dialogue: 0,1:42:40.15,1:42:41.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 麦佛莱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, McFly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:49.58,1:42:51.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,添南 看枪！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just try it, Tannen!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:51.99,1:42:54.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,来呀 小矮子 跳舞呀！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, runt! You can dance better than that!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:21.51,1:43:25.74,Title,0,0,0,0,,《回到未来3》
